184
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:43,880
<font color="#00ffff">Go and find him and bring him here</font>
<font color="#00ffff">at once.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes, sir.</font>

185
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:06,320
<font color="#ffffff">Right, let's see what Dr Tyler's</font>
<font color="#ffffff">found out about that plate.</font>

186
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:10,040
<font color="#ffff00">What's that?</font>

187
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">Jo. Back slowly away behind the car.</font>

188
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:15,760
<font color="#ffffff">Do as I say!</font>

189
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:22,640
<font color="#ffff00">What is it?</font>

190
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">When I tell you to run, you run.</font>

191
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,480
<font color="#ffffff">Right, run!</font>

192
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,720
<font color="#ffff00">What happened?</font>

193
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,920
<font color="#ffff00">What is that?</font><font color="#ffffff"> I don't know.</font>

194
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,040
<font color="#ffff00">Poor old Bessie.</font>

195
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">Right, come on.</font>

196
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:53,200
<font color="#00ffff">Well, where is he?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Sorry, sir,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">we just couldn't find him.</font>

197
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:55,800
<font color="#00ff00">Dr Tyler has just disappeared.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">We've searched the grounds</font>

198
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:57,880
<font color="#00ff00">and the buildings, sir,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and there's no sign of him.</font>

199
00:13:57,880 --> 00:14:00,360
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, and there was an explosion</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in the garage, sir.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Explosion?</font>

200
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:03,240
<font color="#00ffff">What explosion? I heard nothing.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Well, you wouldn't, Brigadier.</font>

201
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:06,120
<font color="#00ff00">But there was a flash, Doctor.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">A flash, yes, not an explosion.</font>

202
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:08,960
<font color="#ffffff">It was a release of kinetic energy.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">One of Bessie's gadgets misfire?</font>

203
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:11,400
<font color="#ffff00">It's far more serious than that,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Brigadier.</font>

204
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:14,480
<font color="#00ffff">You'd better check, Benton.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No. I shouldn't go anywhere near it.</font>

205
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">Not just at the moment.</font>

206
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:19,360
<font color="#00ff00">What SHALL I do, sir?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I suggest that you put a guard</font>

207
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:22,080
<font color="#ffffff">on the drains, Benton.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">The drains?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes, the drains.</font>

208
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,800
<font color="#00ffff">Put the men on standby, Benton.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Right away, sir.</font>

209
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">All right, Brigadier.</font>

210
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">Now, then, what's the situation</font>
<font color="#ffffff">as you see it?</font>

211
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:34,320
<font color="#00ffff">I've just had a call from Mrs Ollis.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Her husband hasn't returned.</font>

212
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:37,080
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes, I was rather afraid</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that might happen.</font>

213
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,960
<font color="#00ffff">We're cooperating</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with the local police,</font>

214
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,160
<font color="#00ffff">but we've got 1,500 acres</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to cover.</font><font color="#ffffff"> I shouldn't bother</font>

215
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,720
<font color="#ffffff">going on looking for him, Brigadier.</font>

216
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,480
<font color="#ffffff">I think you'll find that</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that's Mr Ollis.</font>

217
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,320
<font color="#00ffff">Is this the plate that Tyler</font>
<font color="#00ffff">was developing when we left?</font>

218
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, that's right.</font>

219
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:57,680
<font color="#00ffff">When I came back with</font>
<font color="#00ffff">these satellite reports,</font>

220
00:14:57,680 --> 00:15:01,320
<font color="#00ffff">Tyler had disappeared,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and this box was open</font>

221
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:03,800
<font color="#00ffff">as it is now.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Nothing's been moved?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Nothing.</font>

222
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:05,960
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse me a minute, will you?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Mm.</font>

223
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">GEIGER CRACKLES</font>

224
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,480
<font color="#ffffff">All right, Brigadier, go on.</font>

225
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:26,360
<font color="#00ffff">These are tracking reports</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and assessments</font>

226
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,680
<font color="#00ffff">from just about every country</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the world.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Thank you.</font>

227
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:34,360
<font color="#ffffff">It looks as if Tyler was right.</font>

228
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:37,080
<font color="#ffffff">That light beam, or whatever it is,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">seems to have scanned the Earth</font>

229
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">like a searchlight and picked on us.</font>

230
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:41,000
<font color="#00ffff">Since UNIT is now in charge of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">this investigation, Doctor,</font>

231
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:43,000
<font color="#00ffff">it'd help if you were</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a little more forthcoming.</font>

232
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,120
<font color="#ffff00">Tell him about Bessie, Doctor.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Huh?</font>

233
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes.</font>

234
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,960
<font color="#ffffff">Well, Brigadier,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">now Bessie has disappeared.</font>

235
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,960
<font color="#00ffff">What?</font><font color="#ffff00"> But it was after us.</font>

236
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,600
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, but what was after you?</font>

237
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:55,920
<font color="#ffffff">Some kind of powerful organism thing</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with a very strong hunting instinct.</font>

238
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:57,920
<font color="#ffff00">It was hunting you, wasn't it,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor?</font>

239
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:01,040
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I'm afraid so.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Are you trying to tell me</font>

240
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:04,000
<font color="#00ffff">that this whole thing has been</font>
<font color="#00ffff">arranged just for your benefit?</font>

241
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,320
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, that's right. You see,</font>

242
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:08,040
<font color="#ffff00">that stuff seemed to ignore me</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as soon as it saw the Doctor.</font>

243
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:09,800
<font color="#00ffff">What about this chap Ollis?</font>

244
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,080
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I don't know.</font>

245
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">Well, perhaps this thing</font>
<font color="#ffffff">was confused,</font>

246
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:14,720
<font color="#ffffff">or its instructions</font>
<font color="#ffffff">weren't getting through.</font>

247
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,680
<font color="#00ffff">And Tyler?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Tyler.</font>

248
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:20,080
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font>

249
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:21,920
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, that was its second mistake.</font>

250
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:24,600
<font color="#ffffff">Here in this laboratory</font>
<font color="#ffffff">where I usually work.</font>

251
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:27,200
<font color="#ffffff">And its third mistake was Bessie.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">And you were in Bessie.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>

252
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:31,160
<font color="#00ffff">And you think there's a link between</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the beam and this organism thing.</font>

253
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:32,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I do.</font>

254
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:34,880
<font color="#ffffff">I think that beam was the method</font>
<font color="#ffffff">it used to get here.</font>

255
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:40,680
<font color="#00ffff">Well, now it's arrived,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and it's hostile.</font>

256
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:43,880
<font color="#00ffff">And it's still here, so what do</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we do and how do we find it?</font>

257
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">We don't find it, Brigadier.</font>

258
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:48,880
<font color="#ffffff">If we wait around here long enough,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">it'll find us.</font>

259
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,200
<font color="#ffffff">Holy Moses.</font>

260
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,480
<font color="#ffffff">What's that?</font>

261
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,760
<font color="#ffffff">Get Sergeant Benton, quick.</font>

262
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:20,760
<font color="#ffff00">How many of them?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not sure, Sarge.</font>

263
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:23,000
<font color="#ffffff">They seem to be springing out</font>
<font color="#ffffff">all over the place.</font>

264
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,800
<font color="#ffff00">Right, you hold them off here</font>

265
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,240
<font color="#ffff00">and I'll cover the back.</font>

266
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,440
<font color="#ffff00">You men come with me. Hurry.</font>

267
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,240
<font color="#ffff00">Fire at will.</font>

268
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:33,080
<font color="#ffffff">GUNS FIRE</font>

269
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:43,000
<font color="#00ffff">What are those creatures?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Where are they coming from?</font>

270
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:45,760
<font color="#ffffff">Obviously from the same source</font>
<font color="#ffffff">as that organism thing.</font>

271
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:48,400
<font color="#ffffff">First the scout,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">then the reinforcements.</font>

272
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:50,960
<font color="#00ffff">Their grasp of military tactics</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is very good.</font>

273
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:53,880
<font color="#ffff00">Well, let's hope Sergeant Benton's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">are even better.</font>

274
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,000
<font color="#00ffff">Hurry, men. Keep your heads down.</font>

275
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,000
<font color="#ffffff">GUNFIRE</font>

276
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:12,480
<font color="#ffffff">FIRING CONTINUES</font>

277
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,280
<font color="#ffff00">Great shot, Johnson.</font>

278
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,280
<font color="#ffff00">Brigadier, do you read me? Over.</font>

279
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:25,440
<font color="#00ffff">What's the situation, Benton? Over.</font>

280
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:27,960
<font color="#ffff00">We're under attack from all sides.</font>

281
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:31,800
<font color="#ffff00">Weapons are useless. Nothing seems</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to touch them. Nothing. Over.</font>

282
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:33,200
<font color="#00ffff">Get the men out, Benton.</font>

283
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,720
<font color="#00ffff">Complete evacuation, then report to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">me in the laboratory.</font>

284
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,400
<font color="#00ffff">Is that clear? Over.</font>

285
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:39,640
<font color="#ffff00">OK, lads, fall back.</font><font color="#00ffff"> I'd better see</font>
<font color="#00ffff">what's happening.</font>

286
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,680
<font color="#ffff00">Complete evacuation.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You stay here, Doctor.</font>

287
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">Not much point in my going</font>
<font color="#ffffff">anywhere else, is there?</font>

288
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:46,320
<font color="#ffffff">BENTON:</font><font color="#ffff00"> Everybody, now, move.</font>

289
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:03,720
<font color="#ffffff">I think you ought to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">get out of here too, Jo.</font>

290
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:06,960
<font color="#ffff00">Not a chance. I'm staying right here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Please, Jo, do as I ask.</font>

291
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">They won't harm you. You ignore</font>
<font color="#ffffff">them, they'll ignore you.</font>

292
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:13,040
<font color="#ffffff">I'm the one they're after.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'll just have to risk it, won't I?</font>

293
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:15,000
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, have you seen the Brigadier?</font>

294
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,040
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Benton. Just the man</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I wanted to see.</font>

295
00:19:17,040 --> 00:19:19,720
<font color="#ffffff">Please take Miss Grant with you.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Even if you have to carry her.</font>

296
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:22,920
<font color="#00ffff">I'm sorry, Doc, my orders</font>
<font color="#00ffff">were to report to the Brigadier.</font>

297
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,800
<font color="#ffffff">Into the TARDIS, quick.</font>

298
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">Right, forcefield on.</font>

299
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:34,720
<font color="#ffff00">You were going off without me,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">weren't you?</font>

300
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:37,720
<font color="#ffffff">Well, Sergeant, aren't you going to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">say that it's bigger on the inside</font>

301
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">than it is on the outside?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Everybody else does.</font>

302
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:43,280
<font color="#00ffff">It's pretty obvious, isn't it?</font>

303
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:46,520
<font color="#00ffff">Anyway, nothing to do with you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">surprises me any more, Doctor.</font>

304
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:48,200
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for the compliment.</font>

305
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:50,080
<font color="#ffffff">SHUDDERING THUD</font>

306
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:53,760
<font color="#ffffff">SHUDDERING THUD</font>

307
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:57,760
<font color="#ffffff">SHUDDERING THUD</font>

308
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:57,760
<font color="#ffffff">It's not reacting.</font>

309
00:19:57,760 --> 00:20:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">There's only one thing for it.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'll have to send an SOS.</font>

310
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">I hate having to call them,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">but there we are.</font>

311
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:05,560
<font color="#ffff00">What were you planning to do anyhow?</font>

312
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:08,200
<font color="#ffffff">I was planning to lure that stuff</font>
<font color="#ffffff">away from Earth, Jo,</font>

313
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:10,880
<font color="#ffffff">but now, as it seems to have</font>
<font color="#ffffff">immobilised the TARDIS,</font>

314
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:13,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not going anywhere.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We're trapped.</font>

315
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:16,240
<font color="#ffff00">So what are we going to do?</font><font color="#ffffff"> At least</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we can watch that thing in comfort,</font>

316
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:19,360
<font color="#ffffff">then we can send a report and see</font>
<font color="#ffffff">what they have to say about it.</font>

317
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:20,920
<font color="#00ffff">Who are they?</font>

318
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:22,160
<font color="#ffff00">The Time Lords.</font>

319
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,800
<font color="#ffff00">Things are pretty serious.</font>

320
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:25,560
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, they are.</font>

321
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,880
<font color="#ffffff">BEEPING</font>

322
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:42,160
<font color="#ffffff">Is the Doctor holding out?</font>

323
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:44,720
<font color="#ffff00">We are giving his TARDIS</font>
<font color="#ffff00">all the energy we can spare.</font>

324
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">And the hostile?</font>

325
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:51,600
<font color="#ffffff">Unidentified so far, my lord.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Hmm.</font>

326
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:53,480
<font color="#00ffff">And the source of this beam?</font>

327
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">You see, Chancellor?</font>

328
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,840
<font color="#ffffff">The black hole.</font>

329
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:02,040
<font color="#00ffff">That's a nowhere, no place, a void.</font>

330
00:21:02,040 --> 00:21:05,240
<font color="#00ffff">According to all known laws,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">nothing can exist there.</font>

331
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">Yet somehow, through this black</font>
<font color="#ffffff">hole, vital cosmic energy</font>

332
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">is draining away in spite of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">all we can do to check it.</font>

333
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:13,600
<font color="#00ffff">Already the time-travel facility</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is in danger, my lord.</font>

334
00:21:13,600 --> 00:21:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">Without it, we shall be helpless.</font>

335
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Unless the energy loss is stopped,</font>

336
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">the whole fabric of space-time</font>
<font color="#ffffff">will be destroyed.</font>

337
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">We are being consumed, and we can</font>
<font color="#ffffff">find no way to fight back.</font>

338
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:27,240
<font color="#00ffff">Are you telling me we are up against</font>
<font color="#00ffff">an adversary, a force,</font>

339
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:29,920
<font color="#00ffff">equal to our own?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Equal and opposite to our own.</font>

340
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:31,960
<font color="#00ffff">A force which inhabits a universe</font>

341
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:34,800
<font color="#00ffff">where by definition</font>
<font color="#00ffff">even we cannot exist?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>

342
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:38,280
<font color="#ffffff">A force in the universe</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of antimatter.</font>

343
00:21:39,760 --> 00:21:42,160
<font color="#00ffff">But that's too terrible</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to contemplate.</font>

344
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:43,720
<font color="#00ffff">Someone must go and help the Doctor.</font>

345
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:45,960
<font color="#ffffff">I agree, but no-one can be spared,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Your Excellency.</font>

346
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:48,680
<font color="#ffffff">Everyone is needed to combat</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the energy drain.</font>

347
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:51,320
<font color="#00ffff">Are you saying we can't help him?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I am.</font>

348
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">But perhaps he can help himself.</font>

349
00:21:55,280 --> 00:21:58,720
<font color="#ffffff">Show me the Doctor's timestream,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the section for his earlier self</font>

350
00:21:58,720 --> 00:22:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">before he changed his form.</font>

351
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:03,000
<font color="#00ffff">You can't allow him</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to cross his own time stream.</font>

352
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:06,680
<font color="#00ffff">Apart from the enormous energy</font>
<font color="#00ffff">it would need, the First Law of Time</font>

353
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:09,400
