<font color="#00ffff">to meet his other selves.</font>

354
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:13,080
<font color="#ffffff">I am aware of that, Your Excellency,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">but this is an emergency.</font>

355
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:14,520
<font color="#00ffff">But you can't.</font>

356
00:22:14,520 --> 00:22:17,080
<font color="#ffffff">Your Excellency, I have to.</font>

357
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:21,080
<font color="#00ffff">Be it on your own head.</font>

358
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:28,640
<font color="#ffffff">Now, show me.</font>

359
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:37,640
<font color="#ffffff">VWORP</font>

360
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:38,680
<font color="#ffffff">That's odd.</font>

361
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:40,680
<font color="#ffffff">Nobody touched anything, did they?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No.</font><font color="#ffff00"> No.</font>

362
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:43,400
<font color="#ffffff">You heard it, though, didn't you?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, and felt it too.</font>

363
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:45,960
<font color="#ffff00">Could it be that stuff outside?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No, I don't think so.</font>

364
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,800
<font color="#ffffff">Hello, what's this?</font>

365
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">It seems strangely familiar.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Is it yours, Jo?</font>

366
00:22:53,360 --> 00:22:56,120
<font color="#ffff00">A flute? No.</font>

367
00:22:56,120 --> 00:22:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">Well, properly speaking,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">it's a recorder.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Thank you.</font>

368
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:02,920
<font color="#00ff00">I was wondering</font>
<font color="#00ff00">where that had got to.</font>

369
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:05,480
