370
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:07,600
<font color="#00ff00">You haven't been trying</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to play this, have you?</font>

371
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:11,400
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, I can see you've been</font>
<font color="#00ff00">doing the TARDIS up a bit.</font>

372
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:13,280
<font color="#00ff00">Mm. I don't like it.</font>

373
00:23:13,280 --> 00:23:15,280
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, my word.</font>

374
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:25,640
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, dear.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">We are in trouble, aren't we?</font>

375
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,040
<font color="#00ff00">Just as well I turned up.</font>

376
00:23:27,040 --> 00:23:29,680
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, who on earth...?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, where did you spring from?</font>

377
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:31,320
<font color="#00ff00">Now, don't tell me.</font>

378
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:33,200
