00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:38,960
<font color="#00ff00">since that nasty business</font>
<font color="#00ff00">with the Cybermen.</font>

382
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:42,040
<font color="#00ffff">All those years ago.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Who is he,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and how did he get in here?</font>

383
00:23:42,040 --> 00:23:44,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's a bit difficult to explain, Jo.</font>

384
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:45,440
<font color="#ffff00">He's not one of them, is he?</font>

385
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:47,440
<font color="#ffffff">Well, not so much one of them</font>
<font color="#ffffff">as one of us.</font>

386
