387
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:51,720
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, no, no, no, no!</font>

388
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,920
<font color="#00ff00">I'm sorry, my dear,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I hate to be contrary,</font>

389
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:56,480
<font color="#00ff00">but I can see he's a little bit</font>
<font color="#00ff00">confused, poor old chap,</font>

390
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:58,680
