<font color="#00ff00">the correct explanation.</font>

391
00:23:58,680 --> 00:24:00,000
<font color="#00ff00">You don't mind, do you?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font>

392
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:02,120
<font color="#00ff00">I didn't think you would.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">You see, Jo...</font>

393
00:24:02,120 --> 00:24:04,280
<font color="#00ff00">I may call you Jo, mayn't I?</font>

394
00:24:04,280 --> 00:24:07,360
<font color="#00ff00">You see, he is one of me.</font>

395
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:09,560
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I see. You're both Time Lords.</font>

396
00:24:09,560 --> 00:24:10,600
<font color="#00ff00">Well, quite.</font>

397
00:24:10,600 --> 00:24:12,040
<font color="#00ff00">Well, not quite.</font>

398
00:24:12,040 --> 00:24:14,680
<font color="#ffff00">Oh.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Not just Time Lords.</font>

399
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:17,720
<font color="#00ff00">We're the same Time Lord.</font>

400
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">Please, you're only confusing</font>
<font color="#ffffff">my assistant.</font>

401
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:21,800
<font color="#ffffff">Jo, it's all quite simple.</font>

402
00:24:21,800 --> 00:24:23,880
<font color="#ffffff">I am he and he is me.</font>

403
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:26,400
