<font color="#ffff00">goo goo g'joob?</font><font color="#ffffff"> What?</font>

404
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:29,480
<font color="#00ff00">Hmm?</font><font color="#ffff00"> It's a song by The Beatles.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Oh? How does it go?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Please be quiet.</font>

405
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:31,240
<font color="#ffff00">Look, is he really you?</font>

406
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:33,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, yes, I'm afraid so.</font>

407
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:34,520
<font color="#00ffff">I think he is, Miss Grant.</font>

408
00:24:34,520 --> 00:24:38,760
<font color="#00ffff">You see, when the Brig and I first</font>
<font color="#00ffff">met the Doctor, he looked like him.</font>

409
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:41,400
<font color="#ffff00">How?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, that's what I'd like to know.</font>

410
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:42,720
<font color="#ffffff">You've got no right to be here.</font>

411
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:45,720
<font color="#00ff00">Perhaps...</font><font color="#ffffff"> What about the First Law</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of Time?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Perhaps I could explain.</font>

412
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:48,360
<font color="#ffffff">Perhaps you could.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Well,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">our fellow Time Lords out there</font>

413
00:24:48,360 --> 00:24:50,840
<font color="#00ff00">are just as much under siege</font>
<font color="#00ff00">as we are.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What?</font>

414
00:24:50,840 --> 00:24:53,080
<font color="#00ff00">They couldn't send anyone</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to help you.</font>

415
00:24:53,080 --> 00:24:55,880
<font color="#00ff00">But they did summon up enough</font>
<font color="#00ff00">temporal energy to lift me</font>

416
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:58,640
<font color="#00ff00">out of my bit of our timestream</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and pop me down here,</font>

417
00:24:58,640 --> 00:25:01,400
<font color="#00ff00">into my own future, so to speak.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Why?</font>

418
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:05,320
<font color="#00ff00">My dear fellow, you are being</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a bit dim, aren't you?</font>

419
00:25:05,320 --> 00:25:07,400
<font color="#00ff00">Your effectiveness is now doubled.</font>

420
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">Halved, more like.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Now, now.</font>

421
00:25:09,120 --> 00:25:11,080
<font color="#00ff00">There's no need to be ungracious.</font>

422
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:14,800
<font color="#00ff00">Suppose we have a look</font>
<font color="#00ff00">at our problem, shall we?</font>

423
00:25:14,800 --> 00:25:17,840
<font color="#00ff00">Ah, you don't mind, do you?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, be my guest.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Oh, thank you.</font>

424
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:26,600
<font color="#ffff00">Good grief, sir. What's that?</font>

425
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:29,040
<font color="#ffffff">Don't just stand there, man.</font>
