00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,720
<font color="#ffff00">Sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Fall back.</font>

428
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:36,920
<font color="#00ff00">Dear old Lethbridge-Stewart.</font>
