429
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:38,880
<font color="#ffff00">Can't we do something to help them,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor?</font>

430
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:41,760
<font color="#ffffff">They'll be all right, as long as</font>
<font color="#ffffff">they keep out of its way.</font>

431
00:25:41,760 --> 00:25:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">Right, now you can see our problem,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">can't you?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes.</font>

432
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:46,080
<font color="#00ff00">Most unpleasant.</font>

433
00:25:46,080 --> 00:25:48,240
<font color="#00ff00">They are very worried, you know?</font>

434
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:49,920
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, and so am I.</font>

435
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">I think perhaps I ought to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">put you in the picture.</font>

436
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:54,520
<font color="#00ff00">Right.</font>

437
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:57,160
<font color="#ffffff">Contact.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Contact.</font>

438
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,600
<font color="#00ff00">I see.</font>

439
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:11,760
<font color="#00ff00">So it's after you...</font>

440
00:26:11,760 --> 00:26:13,280
<font color="#00ff00">..or should I say us?</font>

441
00:26:13,280 --> 00:26:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font>

442
00:26:14,760 --> 00:26:17,640
<font color="#ffffff">And as they can't help us,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we'll just have to help ourselves.</font>

443
00:26:17,640 --> 00:26:20,320
<font color="#00ff00">Twinkle, twinkle little star.</font>

444
00:26:22,120 --> 00:26:26,040
<font color="#ffffff">PLAYS TWINKLE, TWINKLE LITTLE STAR</font>

445
00:26:26,040 --> 00:26:29,200
<font color="#00ffff">What was all that about?</font><font color="#ffff00"> A sort of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">telepathic conference, I think.</font>

446
00:26:29,200 --> 00:26:32,280
<font color="#ffffff">Must you?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Are we going to take this</font>
<font color="#00ff00">attitude to my music all the time?</font>

447
00:26:32,280 --> 00:26:33,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'm rather afraid we are.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Oh, dear.</font>

448
00:26:33,960 --> 00:26:35,560
<font color="#ffff00">We've achieved a transference, sir.</font>

449
00:26:35,560 --> 00:26:37,520
<font color="#ffffff">Splendid.</font><font color="#ffff00"> But I don't think</font>
