<font color="#ffffff">Why, what's wrong?</font>

451
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:40,880
<font color="#ffff00">They refuse to cooperate.</font><font color="#ffffff"> I see.</font>

452
00:26:42,360 --> 00:26:45,360
