<font color="#ffffff">I set this thing up...</font>

460
00:27:05,600 --> 00:27:08,040
<font color="#ffff00">Look! Both of you!</font><font color="#ffffff"> What?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Look.</font>

461
00:27:13,560 --> 00:27:15,680
<font color="#00ffff">Ah, there you are.</font>

462
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:19,240
<font color="#00ffff">I seem to be stuck up here. Hmm?</font>

463
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:21,440
<font color="#00ffff">Hmm?</font>

464
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:23,800
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, so you're my replacements.</font>

465
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:25,640
