466
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:28,680
<font color="#00ffff">Have you done anything?</font>

467
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:31,440
<font color="#00ff00">Well, we've, uh,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">assessed the situation.</font>

468
00:27:31,440 --> 00:27:33,240
<font color="#00ffff">Just as I thought.</font>

469
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,680
<font color="#00ffff">Nothing.</font>

470
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:36,080
<font color="#ffffff">Well, it's not easy, you know.</font>

471
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:38,000
<font color="#00ff00">It's not as if we knew</font>
<font color="#00ff00">what that stuff is.</font><font color="#ffffff"> No.</font>

472
