00:27:45,560 --> 00:27:47,760
<font color="#00ffff">Now, what's a bridge for, eh?</font>

475
00:27:47,760 --> 00:27:50,200
<font color="#00ff00">Well, crossing.</font>

476
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:53,200
<font color="#00ffff">Right, so stop dilly-dallying,</font>

477
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:55,040
<font color="#00ffff">and cross it.</font>

478
00:27:56,760 --> 00:27:58,040
<font color="#00ff00">No! No, wait.</font>

479
00:27:58,040 --> 00:28:00,120
<font color="#ffffff">You faded him again.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I did not fade him.</font>

480
00:28:00,120 --> 00:28:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">You certainly did.</font><font color="#ffff00"> I hate to ask,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">but who was that?</font>

481
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:05,080
<font color="#ffffff">TOGETHER: Me.</font>

482
00:28:05,080 --> 00:28:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">TOGETHER: Me!</font>

483
00:28:08,320 --> 00:28:10,080
<font color="#00ff00">Call, will you?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Heads.</font>

484
00:28:11,320 --> 00:28:12,560
<font color="#00ff00">Hard luck.</font>

485
00:28:13,720 --> 00:28:16,360
<font color="#ffffff">All right. Stand by to disconnect</font>
