486
00:28:16,360 --> 00:28:18,240
<font color="#00ffff">What are you going to do?</font>

487
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:20,320
<font color="#ffffff">Now.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, no!</font>

488
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,440
