489
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:24,520
<font color="#00ffff">Steady now, Sergeant!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">He knows what he's doing!</font>

490
00:28:24,520 --> 00:28:27,000
<font color="#00ffff">At least, I hope he does.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">But what about Jo?</font>

491
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:29,560
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, a pity she ran after him</font>
<font color="#00ffff">like that. Let's have a look.</font>

492
00:28:29,560 --> 00:28:31,880
<font color="#00ff00">Will they be all right?</font>

493
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:35,360
<font color="#00ff00">Well, where are they? Doctor?</font>

494
00:28:35,360 --> 00:28:36,600
<font color="#00ffff">As far as I can see,</font>

495
00:28:36,600 --> 00:28:39,240
<font color="#00ffff">that stuff's gone to a great deal</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of trouble to find me. Him.</font>

496
00:28:39,240 --> 00:28:41,200
<font color="#00ffff">So whoever or whatever it was</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that sent it</font>

497
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:42,880
<font color="#00ffff">can't really want</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to kill him, no.</font>

498
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:46,560
<font color="#00ffff">No, they've been transported</font>
<font color="#00ffff">somewhere.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Transported?</font>

499
00:28:46,560 --> 00:28:48,880
