500
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,760
<font color="#00ffff">No, wait a minute.</font>

501
00:28:50,760 --> 00:28:52,840
<font color="#00ffff">Do you know, Sergeant,</font>

502
00:28:52,840 --> 00:28:55,960
<font color="#00ffff">I think our friend has gone</font>
<font color="#00ffff">off the boil, so to speak?</font>

503
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:58,840
<font color="#00ff00">Right, then. I'm going to take</font>
