513
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:41,160
<font color="#00ffff">I think it was just hiccups.</font>

514
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:47,080
<font color="#00ffff">Fascinating.</font>

515
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:48,520
<font color="#ffffff">LOUD BURST OF STATIC</font>

516
00:29:48,520 --> 00:29:50,240
<font color="#ffff00">For heaven's sake,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">be careful, Doctor!</font>

517
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:53,480
<font color="#00ffff">No, Brigadier, leave it alone!</font>
