<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Oh, yes.</font>

520
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:04,320
<font color="#ffff00">But you're...</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes, it is, sir.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">It's the first one.</font>

521
00:30:04,320 --> 00:30:07,200
<font color="#00ffff">How are you, Brigadier?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Pretty well, thanks.</font>

522
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:08,840
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, what the blazes</font>
<font color="#ffff00">are you doing?</font>

523
00:30:08,840 --> 00:30:10,880
<font color="#ffff00">Why have you changed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your appearance?</font>

524
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:12,640
<font color="#ffff00">And what's happened to Miss Grant?</font>

525
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:19,400
<font color="#00ffff">There you are.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">It's all quite simple, really.</font>

526
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:21,680
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, well, I'm sorry.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I don't believe a word of it.</font>

527
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:27,720
<font color="#ffff00">Look, just tell me this.</font>

528
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:31,400
<font color="#ffff00">Are you or are you not the Doctor</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that I met during the Yeti business?</font>

529
00:30:31,400 --> 00:30:33,480
<font color="#ffff00">And then later</font>
<font color="#ffff00">when the Cybermen invaded.</font>

530
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:35,080
<font color="#00ffff">Of course I am.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You can see that.</font>

531
00:30:35,080 --> 00:30:37,280
<font color="#ffff00">Right. But then you subsequently</font>
<font color="#ffff00">appeared on Earth</font>

532
00:30:37,280 --> 00:30:38,960
<font color="#ffff00">during that trouble with the Autons,</font>

533
00:30:38,960 --> 00:30:41,000
<font color="#ffff00">only then you'd changed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">into a tall, thin fellow.</font>

534
00:30:41,000 --> 00:30:43,280
<font color="#00ffff">Had I really? How fascinating.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, I warn you...</font>

535
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:45,920
<font color="#00ffff">It's no use your asking me</font>
<font color="#00ffff">about all this, Brigadier.</font>

536
00:30:45,920 --> 00:30:48,720
<font color="#00ffff">As far as I'm concerned,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">it hasn't happened yet.</font>

537
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:51,280
<font color="#00ffff">Don't you see?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I'm just a temporal anomaly.</font>

538
00:30:58,600 --> 00:31:00,920
<font color="#ffff00">It's quite obvious to me</font>
<font color="#ffff00">what's happened.</font>

539
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:03,960
<font color="#ffff00">You've been mucking around with</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that infernal machine of yours.</font>

540
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,160
<font color="#00ff00">Be careful, sir.</font>

541
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:10,240
<font color="#ffff00">You've been mucking around with</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that infernal machine of yours</font>

542
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:12,280
<font color="#ffff00">and somehow you've changed back</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your appearance</font>

543
00:31:12,280 --> 00:31:14,480
<font color="#ffff00">and shot poor Miss Grant</font>
<font color="#ffff00">off to heaven knows where.</font>

544
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:16,920
<font color="#00ff00">It's not quite as simple as that,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">sir.</font><font color="#ffff00"> That'll do, Benton.</font>

545
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:19,600
<font color="#ffff00">There's just two things I want</font>
<font color="#ffff00">from you, Doctor. An effective way</font>

546
00:31:19,600 --> 00:31:22,400
<font color="#ffff00">of controlling that stuff, and</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the safe return of Miss Grant.</font>

547
00:31:22,400 --> 00:31:24,560
<font color="#00ff00">What about our Doctor, sir?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Don't you want him back?</font>

548
00:31:24,560 --> 00:31:26,720
<font color="#ffff00">Enough of that nonsense.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I've got him back.</font>

549
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:29,520
<font color="#ffff00">As long as he does the job,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">he can wear what face he likes.</font>

550
00:31:29,520 --> 00:31:32,280
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I'll do my best,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">but I can't make any promises.</font>

551
00:31:32,280 --> 00:31:36,440
<font color="#ffff00">In that case, you'd better consult</font>
<font color="#ffff00">those all-powerful superiors</font>

552
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:39,600
<font color="#ffff00">of yours for their advice.</font><font color="#00ffff"> I don't</font>
<font color="#00ffff">think that would do any good.</font>

553
00:31:39,600 --> 00:31:42,040
<font color="#00ffff">At the moment,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">they're far from being all-powerful.</font>

554
00:31:42,040 --> 00:31:44,520
<font color="#00ffff">That's why it's been left</font>
<font color="#00ffff">up to me and me and me.</font>

555
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:53,960
<font color="#ffff00">What's happening?</font><font color="#00ff00"> It's draining away</font>
<font color="#00ff00">power as fast as we pump it in, sir.</font>

556
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:56,840
<font color="#ffff00">Yet you continue to waste</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the power we so urgently need.</font>

557
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:57,880
<font color="#ffff00">What is more,</font>

558
00:31:57,880 --> 00:32:00,120
<font color="#ffff00">by permitting the Doctor</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to meet his other selves,</font>

559
00:32:00,120 --> 00:32:03,680
<font color="#ffff00">you have transgressed the first</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and most important law of time.</font>

560
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:06,080
<font color="#00ff00">I know that, Your Excellency,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but this is an emergency.</font>

561
00:32:06,080 --> 00:32:08,680
<font color="#ffff00">No emergency can justify</font>
<font color="#ffff00">this transgression.</font>

562
00:32:08,680 --> 00:32:11,240
<font color="#ffff00">This operation must stop</font>
<font color="#ffff00">immediately.</font>

563
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:13,360
<font color="#00ffff">On the contrary, it must continue.</font>

564
00:32:13,360 --> 00:32:16,880
<font color="#00ffff">The Doctor is our only hope.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">There is no-one else.</font>

565
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:19,200
<font color="#ffff00">I could wish for more hope</font>
<font color="#ffff00">than that.</font>

566
00:32:20,160 --> 00:32:23,200
<font color="#00ffff">Your Excellency, you have said</font>
<font color="#00ffff">yourself we are dealing with</font>

567
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:26,440
<font color="#00ffff">a threat from an area over which</font>
<font color="#00ffff">even we have no control.</font>

568
00:32:26,440 --> 00:32:30,240
<font color="#00ffff">A black hole in space.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">The universe of anti-matter.</font>

569
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:33,200
<font color="#00ffff">Unknown forces at least equal</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and opposite to our own.</font>

570
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:36,240
<font color="#ffff00">But the first law of time</font>
<font color="#ffff00">must be obeyed!</font>

571
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:38,320
<font color="#00ffff">It will be obeyed, later.</font>

572
00:32:38,320 --> 00:32:40,920
<font color="#00ffff">For the moment, the Doctor needs</font>
<font color="#00ffff">all the help he can get.</font>

573
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:42,760
<font color="#00ffff">We can't stop now.</font>

574
00:32:42,760 --> 00:32:44,960
<font color="#00ffff">Transporting his other selves</font>
<font color="#00ffff">across the timestream</font>

575
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:47,120
<font color="#00ffff">has already utilised more energy</font>
<font color="#00ffff">than we can afford.</font>

576
00:32:47,120 --> 00:32:48,800
<font color="#ffff00">Criminal irresponsibility!</font>

577
00:32:48,800 --> 00:32:51,600
<font color="#00ffff">They have only a limited time</font>
<font color="#00ffff">together.</font>

578
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:55,120
<font color="#00ffff">And if they do not succeed, we shall</font>
<font color="#00ffff">lose our time travel facility</font>

579
00:32:55,120 --> 00:32:58,400
<font color="#00ffff">and become as vulnerable</font>
<font color="#00ffff">as those we are pledged to protect.</font>

580
00:32:58,400 --> 00:33:00,960
<font color="#ffff00">You would do better</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to husband your resources,</font>

581
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:04,200
<font color="#ffff00">not throw them away on what is</font>
<font color="#ffff00">no more than a dangerous gamble.</font>

582
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:06,200
<font color="#00ffff">I am prepared to take that risk.</font>

583
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:09,440
<font color="#ffff00">I understand your attempt</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to transport yet one more Doctor</font>

584
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:11,600
<font color="#ffff00">has met with only limited success.</font>

585
00:33:11,600 --> 00:33:14,800
<font color="#00ffff">His transportation unit</font>
<font color="#00ffff">became trapped in a time eddy.</font>

586
00:33:14,800 --> 00:33:17,240
<font color="#00ffff">At the moment, he can</font>
<font color="#00ffff">do no more than advise.</font>

587
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:20,680
<font color="#00ffff">But the Second Doctor</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is assisting UNIT</font>

588
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:22,720
<font color="#00ffff">to help with matters on Earth.</font>

589
00:33:22,720 --> 00:33:25,400
<font color="#ffff00">I see. And the other?</font>

590
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:33,360
<font color="#00ffff">He, together with his companion,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">has passed into the black hole.</font>

591
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:37,600
<font color="#00ffff">They are over</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the absolute event horizon.</font>

592
00:33:38,960 --> 00:33:40,400
<font color="#ffff00">Theoretically...</font>

593
00:33:41,360 --> 00:33:43,120
<font color="#ffff00">..they're dead.</font>

594
00:33:58,800 --> 00:34:00,320
<font color="#ffffff">Jo?</font>

595
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:03,440
<font color="#ffffff">Jo?</font>

596
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:06,680
<font color="#ffffff">Can you hear me?</font>

597
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">Jo, wake up.</font>

598
00:34:13,680 --> 00:34:15,520
<font color="#ffff00">Where are we?</font>

599
00:34:15,520 --> 00:34:18,680
<font color="#ffff00">Everything seems so...strange.</font>

600
00:34:18,680 --> 00:34:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">Are you all right?</font>

601
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:23,800
<font color="#ffff00">We're not...?</font>

602
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:25,240
<font color="#ffffff">Jo...</font>

603
00:34:25,240 --> 00:34:27,280
<font color="#ffff00">We are, aren't we?</font>

604
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:28,960
<font color="#ffff00">We're dead.</font>

605
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:32,120
<font color="#ffffff">This is a place.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's just like any other place.</font>

606
00:34:34,080 --> 00:34:36,840
<font color="#ffffff">Well, almost.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We've been brought here.</font>

607
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">Anyway...</font>

608
00:34:41,120 --> 00:34:43,160
<font color="#ffffff">..it's not much like heaven, is it?</font>

609
00:34:43,160 --> 00:34:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go and take a look around.</font>

610
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:04,360
<font color="#00ffff">So wherever they are,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Miss Grant and my other self,</font>

611
00:35:04,360 --> 00:35:05,720
<font color="#00ffff">we can't contact them.</font>

612
00:35:05,720 --> 00:35:07,960
<font color="#00ffff">That's the problem</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with anti-matter.</font>

613
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:11,040
<font color="#00ffff">You can see the effect,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">but never the cause.</font>

614
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:14,480
<font color="#00ffff">It's like being punched on the nose</font>
<font color="#00ffff">by the Invisible Man.</font>

615
00:35:15,440 --> 00:35:17,920
<font color="#ffff00">Then what's this stuff?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">The Invisible Man.</font>

616
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:19,600
<font color="#00ffff">Anti-matter.</font>

617
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:22,560
<font color="#ffff00">But I thought you said that matter</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and anti-matter couldn't meet</font>

618
00:35:22,560 --> 00:35:23,800
<font color="#ffff00">without an explosion.</font>

619
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:27,720
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, that's right.</font><font color="#ffff00"> So, it shouldn't</font>
<font color="#ffff00">exist here, but it does.</font>

620
00:35:27,720 --> 00:35:29,760
<font color="#00ffff">Yes. Awkward, isn't it?</font>

621
00:35:31,240 --> 00:35:33,880
<font color="#00ffff">As far as I can see,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">there's only one explanation.</font>

622
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:35,080
<font color="#ffff00">Yes?</font>

623
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:38,160
<font color="#00ffff">This stuff, or whoever sent it,</font>

624
00:35:38,160 --> 00:35:40,160
<font color="#00ffff">is cleverer than we are.</font>

625
00:35:40,160 --> 00:35:42,040
<font color="#00ffff">Unfortunate, isn't it?</font>

626
00:35:43,200 --> 00:35:46,920
<font color="#ffff00">Then there's nothing that even you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">can do?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Oh, I wouldn't say that.</font>

627
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:49,680
<font color="#00ffff">We can make sure</font>
<font color="#00ffff">it stays harmless, for a start.</font>

628
00:35:49,680 --> 00:35:51,600
<font color="#ffff00">Well, that's a relief.</font>

629
00:35:51,600 --> 00:35:53,240
<font color="#ffff00">Look, can I leave you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to get on with that?</font>

630
00:35:53,240 --> 00:35:56,960
<font color="#ffff00">Those other things are still outside</font>
<font color="#ffff00">there. I must contact Geneva.</font>

631
00:36:01,280 --> 00:36:04,120
<font color="#00ff00">Doc, I think the strain's been</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a bit too much for him.</font>

632
00:36:05,080 --> 00:36:07,560
<font color="#00ff00">What are we going to do now?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Keep it confused.</font>

633
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:10,120
<font color="#00ffff">Feed it with useless information.</font>

634
00:36:10,120 --> 00:36:12,320
<font color="#00ffff">I wonder if I have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a television set handy.</font>

635
00:36:16,600 --> 00:36:18,400
<font color="#ffffff">That's odd.</font>

636
00:36:22,720 --> 00:36:24,640
<font color="#ffffff">WIND HOWLS</font>

637
00:36:26,800 --> 00:36:28,240
<font color="#ffff00">Hey!</font>

638
00:36:28,240 --> 00:36:31,480
<font color="#ffff00">Surely that's the water cooler</font>
<font color="#ffff00">from outside the lab.</font>

639
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:32,520
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font>

640
00:36:34,200 --> 00:36:37,520
<font color="#ffff00">And what's this?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Well, that's</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Brigadier's computer.</font>

641
00:36:37,520 --> 00:36:38,560
<font color="#ffff00">Oh.</font>

642
00:36:38,560 --> 00:36:40,880
<font color="#ffffff">Look, this is the lab door.</font>

643
00:36:45,560 --> 00:36:48,240
<font color="#ffff00">It's locked.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Well, it says No Admittance.</font>

644
00:36:57,360 --> 00:36:58,640
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font>

645
00:37:00,320 --> 00:37:03,240
<font color="#ffffff">Well, we both know what that is,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">don't we?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Sure do.</font>

646
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:06,640
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, Jo, do you see what I see?</font>

647
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:10,080
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, yes!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Well, that clinches it.</font>

648
00:37:10,080 --> 00:37:13,440
<font color="#ffffff">We have been transported.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">And so has all this stuff.</font>

649
00:37:14,400 --> 00:37:16,040
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font>

650
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:34,280
<font color="#ffffff">Right, all we've got to do is</font>
<font color="#ffffff">find out where we are</font>

651
00:37:34,280 --> 00:37:37,280
<font color="#ffffff">and who brought us here.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Right. Come on, then.</font>

652
00:37:37,280 --> 00:37:39,160
<font color="#ffffff">Where to?</font>

653
00:37:39,160 --> 00:37:42,000
<font color="#ffff00">Twice round the park?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Right.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Right.</font>

654
00:38:13,040 --> 00:38:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">Man Friday, would you believe?</font>

655
00:38:15,200 --> 00:38:17,240
<font color="#ffff00">At the moment,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'd believe anything.</font>

656
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:20,320
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font>

657
00:38:29,240 --> 00:38:31,280
<font color="#ffffff">CRACKLING STATIC</font>

658
00:38:38,120 --> 00:38:41,520
<font color="#00ffff">It's quite like old times, eh,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Sergeant?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes, it is, isn't it?</font>

659
00:38:41,520 --> 00:38:43,520
<font color="#00ff00">Is it ready yet?</font>

660
00:38:43,520 --> 00:38:45,560
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, nearly ready for testing.</font>

661
00:38:45,560 --> 00:38:47,000
<font color="#00ff00">Look, Doc, why don't we give</font>

662
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:50,200
<font color="#00ff00">this great, big, overgrown</font>
<font color="#00ff00">blancmange the full treatment?</font>

663
00:38:50,200 --> 00:38:52,240
<font color="#00ffff">Now steady on, Sergeant.</font>

664
00:38:53,200 --> 00:38:56,160
<font color="#ffff00">Right, come on, Doctor. The Security</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Council want an explanation</font>

665
00:38:56,160 --> 00:38:58,520
<font color="#ffff00">and I'm leaving it all up to you.</font>

666
00:38:58,520 --> 00:39:00,000
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, no!</font>

667
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:02,280
<font color="#ffff00">They're on video in my office.</font>

668
00:39:02,280 --> 00:39:05,240
<font color="#00ffff">But won't they think it's strange?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I mean, me?</font>

669
00:39:05,240 --> 00:39:07,280
<font color="#ffff00">I've explained all that.</font>

670
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:10,040
<font color="#ffff00">You're his assistant.</font><font color="#00ffff"> His what?!</font>

671
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:14,360
<font color="#ffff00">I decided the truth was too much for</font>
<font color="#ffff00">them. Assistant it will have to be.</font>

672
00:39:17,440 --> 00:39:18,840
<font color="#ffff00">Well?</font>

673
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:22,320
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I've just set this thing up</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in order to be able to confuse it!</font>

674
00:39:22,320 --> 00:39:25,680
<font color="#ffff00">No doubt. Seems to be your forte,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, confusing people.</font>

675
00:39:26,640 --> 00:39:28,000
<font color="#ffff00">You sure that thing's all right?</font>

676
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:30,600
<font color="#00ffff">Quiet as a lamb. We've got it</font>
<font color="#00ffff">thoroughly subdued, eh, Sergeant?</font>

677
00:39:30,600 --> 00:39:33,760
<font color="#00ff00">We haven't tested it.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Benton,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you better keep an eye on it.</font>

678
00:39:33,760 --> 00:39:35,640
<font color="#00ff00">Me, sir?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes, you!</font>

679
00:39:35,640 --> 00:39:37,880
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, very well.</font>

680
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:40,200
<font color="#00ffff">Here you are, Sergeant.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You'll need this.</font>

681
00:39:40,200 --> 00:39:42,080
<font color="#00ffff">Now, if it gives</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the slightest trouble,</font>

682
00:39:42,080 --> 00:39:43,920
<font color="#00ffff">a little dose of that</font>
<font color="#00ffff">will settle it.</font>

683
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:47,280
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, but say that doesn't work,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Then give it the lot!</font>

684
00:39:47,280 --> 00:39:48,920
<font color="#00ffff">Come on.</font>

685
00:40:09,760 --> 00:40:13,200
<font color="#00ff00">Now you're not going to give me</font>
<font color="#00ff00">any trouble, are you? OK?</font>

686
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:18,520
<font color="#ffffff">BURST OF LOUDER STATIC</font>

687
00:40:28,840 --> 00:40:30,680
<font color="#ffffff">CRACKLING</font>

688
00:40:34,160 --> 00:40:35,600
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor?</font>

689
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:37,640
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor, are you there?</font>

690
00:40:39,960 --> 00:40:42,000
<font color="#ffffff">CRACKLING</font>

691
00:40:39,960 --> 00:40:42,000
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor!</font>

692
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:44,120
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor! Doctor!</font>

693
00:40:44,120 --> 00:40:46,800
<font color="#00ffff">Oh!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Benton, what have you done?!</font>

694
00:40:46,800 --> 00:40:49,280
<font color="#00ff00">I did what the Doctor told me, sir!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">It wouldn't work.</font>

695
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:51,480
<font color="#00ffff">To the TARDIS, quickly!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Come on, Brigadier!</font>

696
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:03,520
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, it's quite cosy, isn't it?</font>

697
00:41:03,520 --> 00:41:05,320
<font color="#00ffff">You'll soon get used to it,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">old chap.</font>

698
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:07,040
<font color="#00ffff">Relative dimensions and all that.</font>

699
00:41:07,040 --> 00:41:10,160
<font color="#ffff00">So this is what you've been doing</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with UNIT funds and equipment</font>

700
00:41:10,160 --> 00:41:11,360
<font color="#ffff00">all this time.</font>

701
00:41:11,360 --> 00:41:14,320
<font color="#ffff00">How's it done?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Some sort of optical illusion?</font>

702
00:41:14,320 --> 00:41:16,920
<font color="#00ffff">No, no, no. They come like this,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">really.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yeah.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Hey, Doc.</font>

703
00:41:16,920 --> 00:41:18,280
<font color="#00ff00">It's going berserk out there.</font>

704
00:41:18,280 --> 00:41:20,680
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, it is.</font><font color="#ffff00"> All right,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">now we're in here, what do we do?</font>

705
00:41:20,680 --> 00:41:22,920
<font color="#00ffff">Well, we have a think.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Care for a jelly baby?</font>

706
00:41:24,160 --> 00:41:27,160
<font color="#00ff00">E equals MC...</font>

707
00:41:27,160 --> 00:41:29,200
<font color="#00ff00">..squared.</font>

708
00:41:29,200 --> 00:41:30,760
<font color="#00ff00">There's no doubt about that.</font>

709
00:41:31,720 --> 00:41:34,880
<font color="#00ff00">But if you equate gravitation</font>
<font color="#00ff00">with acceleration...</font>

710
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:38,680
<font color="#00ff00">I must have travelled</font>
<font color="#00ff00">faster than the speed of light.</font>

711
00:41:38,680 --> 00:41:40,640
<font color="#00ff00">Ha! That's impossible.</font>

712
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:44,720
<font color="#00ff00">By definition. The light here</font>
<font color="#00ff00">must be travelling backwards</font>

713
00:41:44,720 --> 00:41:47,360
<font color="#00ff00">because I can still see.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Who's that?</font>

714
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">It's Dr Tyler.</font>

715
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,960
<font color="#ffffff">Dr Tyler!</font>

716
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:52,200
<font color="#00ff00">Huh?</font>

717
00:41:52,200 --> 00:41:54,440
<font color="#00ff00">Why, it's the Doctor, isn't it?</font>

718
00:41:54,440 --> 00:41:57,480
<font color="#00ff00">And Miss Grant!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">How did you get here?</font>

719
00:41:57,480 --> 00:42:00,440
<font color="#00ff00">Well, I was in your lab</font>
<font color="#00ff00">developing that plate,</font>

720
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:02,520
<font color="#00ff00">and there was</font>
<font color="#00ff00">some kind of an explosion.</font>

721
00:42:02,520 --> 00:42:04,360
<font color="#00ff00">And here I am.</font>

722
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:07,280
<font color="#00ff00">Ah, it's fascinating.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Do you know</font>
<font color="#ffff00">where we are, Dr Tyler?</font>

723
00:42:07,280 --> 00:42:10,040
<font color="#00ff00">No, I don't. Do you, Doctor?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>

724
00:42:10,040 --> 00:42:12,760
<font color="#ffffff">We're at the other end</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of that light streak of yours.</font>

725
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:15,920
<font color="#00ff00">What?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We've been transported along it.</font>

726
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:19,280
<font color="#00ff00">That's in the black hole.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, exactly. That's where we are.</font>

727
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:22,240
<font color="#ffffff">On a stable world</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in a universe of anti-matter.</font>

728
00:42:22,240 --> 00:42:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">An anomaly within an impossibility.</font>

729
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:26,200
<font color="#ffff00">Huh?</font>

730
00:42:26,200 --> 00:42:29,400
<font color="#00ff00">What he means is that a place</font>
<font color="#00ff00">like this shouldn't exist.</font>

731
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:31,000
<font color="#00ff00">In a cosmos like this.</font>

732
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:33,120
<font color="#00ff00">And even if it does,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">we shouldn't be here anyway.</font>

733
00:42:33,120 --> 00:42:35,040
<font color="#00ff00">I think.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Oh.</font>

734
00:42:36,360 --> 00:42:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">Well, here we are.</font>

735
00:42:39,120 --> 00:42:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">Kidnapped and marooned.</font>

736
00:42:42,040 --> 00:42:43,760
<font color="#ffffff">But by whom?</font>

737
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:47,000
<font color="#00ffff">At last!</font>

738
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:49,640
<font color="#00ffff">A Time Lord within my power!</font>

739
00:42:50,720 --> 00:42:53,560
<font color="#00ffff">Let my guests be brought</font>
<font color="#00ffff">into my presence.</font>

740
00:42:58,880 --> 00:43:01,680
<font color="#ffffff">These things sound very much like</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the creatures that attacked us</font>

741
00:43:01,680 --> 00:43:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">at UNIT HQ.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

742
00:43:03,080 --> 00:43:05,280
<font color="#ffffff">What exactly did they look like?</font>

743
00:43:06,400 --> 00:43:08,120
<font color="#00ff00">Like that!</font>

744
00:43:09,080 --> 00:43:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">Run!</font>

745
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:12,840
<font color="#ffff00">Aaaah!</font>

746
00:43:20,200 --> 00:43:22,360
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, will you open this door?</font>

747
00:43:22,360 --> 00:43:24,400
<font color="#00ff00">It's still thrashing about</font>
<font color="#00ff00">out there, sir.</font>

748
00:43:24,400 --> 00:43:27,840
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, it is, isn't it? My little</font>
<font color="#00ffff">plan seems to have misfired.</font>

749
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:30,880
<font color="#00ffff">I seem to have accentuated</font>
<font color="#00ffff">its metabolic rate.</font>

750
00:43:30,880 --> 00:43:33,440
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Most unfortunate.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Shouldn't have happened.</font>

751
00:43:33,440 --> 00:43:34,920
<font color="#00ffff">I wonder where it went wrong.</font>

752
00:43:34,920 --> 00:43:36,880
<font color="#ffff00">Will you let me out</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of this contraption?!</font>

753
00:43:36,880 --> 00:43:39,560
<font color="#00ffff">The beam should have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">desensitised it.</font>

754
00:43:39,560 --> 00:43:41,720
<font color="#00ffff">Of course! You fool!</font>

755
00:43:41,720 --> 00:43:45,000
<font color="#00ffff">It's anti-matter.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">The opposite effect.</font>

756
00:43:45,000 --> 00:43:47,440
<font color="#00ffff">Instead of quietening it down,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I've stimulated it.</font>

757
00:43:47,440 --> 00:43:49,280
<font color="#ffff00">Will you stop nattering?</font>

758
00:43:49,280 --> 00:43:51,320
<font color="#00ffff">You haven't seen my recorder</font>
<font color="#00ffff">anywhere, have you?</font>

759
00:43:51,320 --> 00:43:53,080
<font color="#00ffff">A little thing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">this long with holes in it.</font>

760
00:43:53,080 --> 00:43:55,520
<font color="#00ffff">I had it when I came in</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and I put it down somewhere...</font>

761
00:43:55,520 --> 00:43:58,320
<font color="#ffff00">For the last time, will you let me</font>
<font color="#ffff00">out of this madhouse?!</font><font color="#00ffff"> No point!</font>

762
00:43:58,320 --> 00:44:00,320
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sorry, Doctor, but I'm afraid</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I must insist.</font>

763
00:44:00,320 --> 00:44:01,720
<font color="#ffff00">My place is with the men out there</font>

764
00:44:01,720 --> 00:44:04,240
<font color="#ffff00">trying to do something about,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">well, whatever it is out there.</font>

765
00:44:04,240 --> 00:44:05,960
<font color="#ffff00">Not standing about here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">messing around</font>

766
00:44:05,960 --> 00:44:09,080
<font color="#ffff00">looking for some damn fool flute!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Brigadier, I cannot open that door</font>

767
00:44:09,080 --> 00:44:11,040
<font color="#00ffff">without first turning off</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the forcefield,</font>

768
00:44:11,040 --> 00:44:13,400
<font color="#00ffff">and even if I did, you'd never</font>
<font color="#00ffff">make it across the floor.</font>

769
00:44:13,400 --> 00:44:15,560
<font color="#00ffff">That thing out there's</font>
<font color="#00ffff">become a killer!</font>

770
00:44:15,560 --> 00:44:17,480
<font color="#00ffff">It's my fault, and I'm sorry.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Sorry?</font>

771
00:44:17,480 --> 00:44:19,560
<font color="#00ffff">All we can do now is think.</font>

772
00:44:19,560 --> 00:44:22,680
<font color="#00ffff">And I think best to music.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Now, where is my recorder?</font>

773
00:44:31,520 --> 00:44:33,560
<font color="#ffff00">It looks like Aladdin's cave!</font>

774
00:44:33,560 --> 00:44:36,560
<font color="#ffffff">It's the entrance to some sort</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of palace, I should imagine.</font>

775
00:44:36,560 --> 00:44:38,640
<font color="#00ff00">I wonder who it belongs to.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I've no idea,</font>

776
00:44:38,640 --> 00:44:40,680
<font color="#ffffff">but I expect we'll soon find out.</font>

777
00:44:40,680 --> 00:44:42,320
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not sure I really want to.</font>

778
00:44:42,320 --> 00:44:45,360
<font color="#00ff00">Whoever had us brought here</font>
<font color="#00ff00">doesn't mean us much good.</font>

779
00:44:45,360 --> 00:44:47,040
<font color="#ffff00">I have a feeling</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you might be right.</font>

780
00:44:47,040 --> 00:44:49,200
<font color="#00ff00">And I don't fancy hanging around</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to meet him.</font>

781
00:44:49,200 --> 00:44:52,200
<font color="#00ff00">I'm going to try and make</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a break for it.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What?</font>

782
00:44:54,880 --> 00:44:57,880
<font color="#ffff00">Corporal Palmer? This is the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Brigadier.</font><font color="#00ffff"> You're wasting your time.</font>

783
00:44:57,880 --> 00:44:59,920
<font color="#00ffff">You'll never get through</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with the forcefield on.</font>

784
00:44:59,920 --> 00:45:01,800
<font color="#ffff00">I've got to find out</font>
<font color="#ffff00">what's going on out there.</font>

785
00:45:01,800 --> 00:45:03,760
<font color="#00ffff">Let's have a look at this thing.</font>

786
00:45:03,760 --> 00:45:07,560
<font color="#00ffff">I'll try to set you up</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a communications unit.</font>

787
00:45:07,560 --> 00:45:09,960
<font color="#ffff00">Be careful.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">It's all right. Don't worry.</font>

788
00:45:09,960 --> 00:45:13,200
<font color="#00ffff">I can boost this through the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">TARDIS's communication circuits.</font>

789
00:45:14,320 --> 00:45:16,040
<font color="#00ffff">I think.</font>

790
00:45:16,040 --> 00:45:19,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I give up.</font><font color="#00ff00"> With respect, sir,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">we're wasting time.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes, we are.</font>

791
00:45:19,600 --> 00:45:22,160
<font color="#00ffff">You still worried about</font>
<font color="#00ffff">your other Doctor, Sergeant?</font>

792
00:45:22,160 --> 00:45:24,480
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, I am. And Miss Grant.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I shouldn't worry too much,</font>

793
00:45:24,480 --> 00:45:27,240
<font color="#00ffff">if I were you.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">In fact, I rather envy them.</font>

794
00:45:27,240 --> 00:45:31,440
<font color="#00ff00">You what?!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes. I think they're</font>
<font color="#00ffff">having a very interesting time.</font>

795
00:45:32,920 --> 00:45:34,960
<font color="#00ff00">The time to make a getaway is now.</font>

796
00:45:34,960 --> 00:45:36,960
<font color="#00ff00">While we're still</font>
<font color="#00ff00">near the entrance.</font>

797
00:45:36,960 --> 00:45:39,720
<font color="#00ff00">Once they get us down that maze of</font>
<font color="#00ff00">passageways, we'll never get out.</font>

798
00:45:39,720 --> 00:45:42,360
<font color="#ffffff">My dear Dr Tyler,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want to get out.</font>

799
00:45:42,360 --> 00:45:44,040
<font color="#ffffff">I want to meet our host.</font>

800
00:45:44,040 --> 00:45:46,640
<font color="#ffffff">I allowed myself to be brought here</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for that very purpose.</font>

801
00:45:46,640 --> 00:45:48,960
<font color="#00ff00">Perhaps you did, Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but we didn't want to come here.</font>

802
00:45:48,960 --> 00:45:50,120
<font color="#00ff00">And we don't want to stay.</font>

803
00:45:50,120 --> 00:45:52,840
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you understand? You were</font>
<font color="#ffffff">both brought here by accident.</font>

804
00:45:52,840 --> 00:45:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">Your only chance of getting back</font>

805
00:45:54,200 --> 00:45:56,600
<font color="#ffffff">is my persuading whoever brought</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you here to send you home.</font>

806
00:45:56,600 --> 00:45:58,320
<font color="#00ff00">I prefer to take a chance</font>
<font color="#00ff00">on my own.</font>

807
00:45:58,320 --> 00:46:00,760
<font color="#00ff00">What about you, Miss Grant?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">You coming with me?</font>

808
00:46:02,040 --> 00:46:05,120
<font color="#ffff00">No. No, I'll stick with the Doctor,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">thank you.</font>

809
00:46:06,080 --> 00:46:08,160
<font color="#00ff00">Looks like I'll have to go</font>
<font color="#00ff00">on my own, then.</font>

810
00:46:08,160 --> 00:46:10,720
<font color="#ffffff">Dr Tyler...</font><font color="#00ff00"> Hm?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You're not going anywhere.</font>

811
00:46:10,720 --> 00:46:13,720
<font color="#00ff00">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"> I refuse to allow you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to endanger all our lives.</font>

812
00:46:17,840 --> 00:46:18,880
<font color="#00ff00">No.</font>

813
00:46:19,840 --> 00:46:22,040
<font color="#00ff00">No, I suppose you're right.</font>

814
00:46:23,240 --> 00:46:26,040
<font color="#ffffff">Tyler! Tyler, come back! Tyler!</font>

815
00:46:35,880 --> 00:46:39,240
<font color="#ffffff">Idiot. He'll jeopardise</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the entire operation.</font>

816
00:46:39,240 --> 00:46:41,280
<font color="#ffff00">With his life, probably.</font>

817
00:46:41,280 --> 00:46:42,720
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font>

818
00:47:00,320 --> 00:47:03,920
<font color="#ffff00">They might not harm him. You said</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we were only here by mistake.</font>

819
00:47:03,920 --> 00:47:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, that's right, Jo.</font>

820
00:47:07,600 --> 00:47:09,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'm the one they're after.</font>

821
00:47:09,640 --> 00:47:12,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sure I can persuade our host</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to send you back.</font>

822
00:47:12,800 --> 00:47:14,880
<font color="#ffff00">But supposing you can't?</font>

823
00:47:14,880 --> 00:47:17,560
<font color="#ffff00">Well, they might just...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">get rid of us.</font>

824
00:47:28,440 --> 00:47:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">Jo, we're dealing here with</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a creature of great intelligence.</font>

825
00:47:31,000 --> 00:47:33,640
<font color="#ffffff">And superior intelligence</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and senseless cruelty</font>

826
00:47:33,640 --> 00:47:37,280
<font color="#ffffff">just do not go together.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I hope you're right.</font>

827
00:47:39,280 --> 00:47:41,360
<font color="#ffffff">Tyler, come on. Get up!</font>

828
00:47:41,360 --> 00:47:43,040
<font color="#ffffff">Up, up!</font>

829
00:47:44,560 --> 00:47:47,320
<font color="#ffffff">You all right?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes. I think so.</font>

830
00:47:47,320 --> 00:47:48,880
<font color="#00ff00">Thanks.</font>

831
00:47:50,160 --> 00:47:52,720
<font color="#00ff00">That was a bit of a waste of time,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">wasn't it?</font>

832
00:48:02,280 --> 00:48:04,840
<font color="#00ffff">Here we are, Brigadier.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Have a try with that.</font>

833
00:48:08,400 --> 00:48:10,440
<font color="#00ffff">It's all right. It won't bite you.</font>

834
00:48:11,760 --> 00:48:13,960
<font color="#ffff00">Corporal Palmer? Come in, Palmer.</font>

835
00:48:13,960 --> 00:48:16,080
<font color="#ffffff">STATIC INTERFERENCE</font>

836
00:48:21,400 --> 00:48:23,440
<font color="#ffffff">Corporal Palmer here. Over.</font>

837
00:48:24,800 --> 00:48:26,560
<font color="#ffff00">Corporal Palmer, this is</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the Brigadier.</font>

838
00:48:26,560 --> 00:48:28,840
<font color="#ffff00">Now listen. We're pinned down</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in the laboratory.</font>

839
00:48:28,840 --> 00:48:31,880
<font color="#ffff00">What's the situation there? Over.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Sir, we've been trying to reach you.</font>

840
00:48:31,880 --> 00:48:33,520
<font color="#ffffff">The building is still surrounded.</font>

841
00:48:33,520 --> 00:48:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">We're just standing by</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for further orders. Over.</font>

842
00:48:36,240 --> 00:48:39,520
<font color="#ffff00">Now listen, Palmer. I want</font>
<font color="#ffff00">every man to maintain vigilance,</font>

843
00:48:39,520 --> 00:48:42,560
<font color="#ffff00">but no further offensive action.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Is that clear? Over.</font>

844
00:48:42,560 --> 00:48:45,960
<font color="#ffffff">But, sir...</font><font color="#ffff00"> That's an order, Palmer!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Roger, sir. Wilco.</font>

845
00:48:45,960 --> 00:48:48,240
<font color="#ffff00">Keep in contact. Out.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Doc? Hey, Doctor.</font>

846
00:48:48,240 --> 00:48:50,240
<font color="#00ff00">It's the old bloke again.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, excuse me.</font>

847
00:48:52,800 --> 00:48:55,640
<font color="#ffffff">Well, any progress?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No, none at all. And you?</font>

848
00:48:55,640 --> 00:48:57,040
<font color="#ffffff">Hardly.</font>

849
00:48:57,040 --> 00:48:59,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm trapped</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in this infernal time eddy.</font>

850
00:48:59,840 --> 00:49:02,680
<font color="#00ffff">What about our fellow Time Lords?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Steadily weaker.</font>

851
00:49:02,680 --> 00:49:05,080
<font color="#ffffff">They can't seem to check</font>
<font color="#ffffff">their energy loss.</font>

852
00:49:05,080 --> 00:49:10,040
<font color="#00ffff">We can't help you, I'm afraid.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes, you could.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Oh? How?</font>

853
00:49:10,040 --> 00:49:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">Well, first,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">turn off your forcefield.</font>

854
00:49:12,560 --> 00:49:14,640
<font color="#00ffff">What? But I don't...</font>

855
00:49:14,640 --> 00:49:17,800
<font color="#ffffff">Off, I said!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">But I still don't see...</font>

856
00:49:17,800 --> 00:49:20,040
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, use your intelligence!</font>

857
00:49:25,400 --> 00:49:27,480
<font color="#ffff00">Who in the name of heaven was that?</font>

858
00:49:28,840 --> 00:49:30,880
<font color="#00ffff">I'm afraid you'd never believe me.</font>

859
00:49:42,000 --> 00:49:44,320
<font color="#00ff00">It still doesn't make sense,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor.</font>

860
00:49:44,320 --> 00:49:47,760
<font color="#00ff00">We are matter and you say</font>
<font color="#00ff00">this place is anti-matter.</font>

861
00:49:47,760 --> 00:49:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font><font color="#00ff00"> So the mere fact</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of our being here</font>

862
00:49:50,760 --> 00:49:53,080
<font color="#00ff00">should cause a colossal explosion.</font>

863
00:49:53,080 --> 00:49:54,800
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, but our bodies</font>
<font color="#ffffff">have been converted,</font>

864
00:49:54,800 --> 00:49:56,800
<font color="#ffffff">processed in some way</font>
<font color="#ffffff">so that we can exist here.</font>

865
00:49:56,800 --> 00:50:00,040
<font color="#ffff00">Just as that organism could exist</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in our world?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes, exactly.</font>

866
00:50:00,040 --> 00:50:02,240
<font color="#00ff00">I just don't believe it.</font>

867
00:50:02,240 --> 00:50:04,840
<font color="#00ff00">This is matter. I can see it.</font>

868
00:50:06,280 --> 00:50:09,560
<font color="#00ff00">I can feel it.</font><font color="#ffffff"> But things aren't</font>
<font color="#ffffff">always as they seem, Dr Tyler.</font>

869
00:50:09,560 --> 00:50:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">Now, you take this pencil,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for example.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Hmm.</font>

870
00:50:12,520 --> 00:50:15,080
<font color="#00ff00">Well, it's just a pencil, isn't it?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, but is it?</font>

871
00:50:15,080 --> 00:50:17,120
<font color="#ffffff">Watch very, very closely.</font>

872
00:50:17,120 --> 00:50:18,280
<font color="#ffffff">F'tum!</font>

873
00:50:19,560 --> 00:50:20,760
<font color="#ffffff">Or is it a bunch of flowers?</font>

874
00:50:20,760 --> 00:50:23,440
<font color="#00ff00">Ha! That's all very well,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but that's just a conjuring trick.</font>

875
00:50:23,440 --> 00:50:25,320
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. That's exactly</font>
<font color="#ffffff">what this place is.</font>

876
00:50:25,320 --> 00:50:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">A scientific conjuring trick</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of a very high order.</font>

877
00:50:28,680 --> 00:50:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">ORGANISMS GRUMBLE</font>

878
00:50:28,680 --> 00:50:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">I think the waiting is over.</font>

879
00:50:38,400 --> 00:50:41,280
<font color="#ffff00">You're not going to turn off</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the forcefield?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes, I think so.</font>

880
00:50:41,280 --> 00:50:43,520
<font color="#ffff00">But why?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Because he told me to.</font>

881
00:50:43,520 --> 00:50:46,240
<font color="#00ffff">And I've always had</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a great respect for his advice.</font>

882
00:50:46,240 --> 00:50:48,200
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor, if you switch</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the forcefield off,</font>

883
00:50:48,200 --> 00:50:50,160
<font color="#00ff00">that thing out there</font>
<font color="#00ff00">can get at the TARDIS!</font>

884
00:50:51,120 --> 00:50:53,400
<font color="#00ffff">Precisely!</font>

885
00:50:53,400 --> 00:50:54,920
<font color="#00ffff">Hold tight, everyone.</font>

886
00:51:26,200 --> 00:51:27,880
<font color="#ffff00">Fabulous!</font>

887
00:51:27,880 --> 00:51:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, most impressive.</font>

888
00:51:30,680 --> 00:51:31,960
<font color="#ffffff">I can admit that.</font>

889
00:51:31,960 --> 00:51:35,520
<font color="#00ff00">Almost worth the trip</font>
<font color="#00ff00">just to see this place.</font>

890
00:51:36,680 --> 00:51:38,760
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, but who brought us here,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and why?</font>

891
00:51:38,760 --> 00:51:40,360
<font color="#00ffff">I did.</font>

892
00:51:40,360 --> 00:51:42,440
<font color="#00ffff">I am the one who brought you here.</font>

893
00:51:42,440 --> 00:51:44,200
<font color="#ffffff">Who are you?</font>

894
00:51:44,200 --> 00:51:47,720
<font color="#00ffff">In the legends of your people,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I am called Omega.</font>

895
00:51:48,840 --> 00:51:50,280
<font color="#ffffff">Omega?</font>

896
00:51:50,280 --> 00:51:52,320
<font color="#ffffff">But that's impossible!</font>

897
00:51:52,320 --> 00:51:55,400
<font color="#ffffff">Omega was destroyed.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No, brother Time Lord.</font>

898
00:51:55,400 --> 00:51:57,400
<font color="#00ffff">I was not destroyed.</font>

899
00:51:58,880 --> 00:52:00,960
<font color="#00ffff">As you can see!</font>

900
00:52:04,320 --> 00:52:06,440
<font color="#00ffff">Take the man and the girl.</font>

901
00:52:06,440 --> 00:52:09,520
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you taking them?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">They will not be harmed, Doctor.</font>

902
00:52:09,520 --> 00:52:11,840
<font color="#00ffff">They have no part in my revenge.</font>

903
00:52:20,160 --> 00:52:23,240
<font color="#00ffff">I have been grievously wronged,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor,</font>

904
00:52:23,240 --> 00:52:26,640
<font color="#00ffff">and now it is time</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for my vengeance!</font>

905
00:52:41,680 --> 00:52:43,800
<font color="#00ff00">Well, they won't hold us long</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in here,</font>

906
00:52:43,800 --> 00:52:45,640
<font color="#00ff00">locked in a cell without a door.</font>

907
00:52:48,360 --> 00:52:49,760
<font color="#ffff00">Look!</font>

908
00:52:51,640 --> 00:52:53,560
<font color="#00ff00">It's impossible!</font>

909
00:52:57,400 --> 00:52:59,320
<font color="#00ff00">It's a real wall!</font>

910
00:52:59,320 --> 00:53:00,960
<font color="#ffff00">Real?</font>

911
00:53:00,960 --> 00:53:03,160
<font color="#ffff00">What kind of a place is this?</font>

912
00:53:03,160 --> 00:53:05,560
<font color="#ffff00">And who was that creature</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in the mask?</font>

913
00:53:05,560 --> 00:53:08,520
<font color="#00ff00">I don't know.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">The Doctor seemed to know him.</font>

914
00:53:08,520 --> 00:53:09,840
<font color="#00ff00">Yes.</font>

915
00:53:09,840 --> 00:53:12,160
<font color="#00ff00">And whoever it was knew the Doctor,</font>

916
00:53:12,160 --> 00:53:14,480
<font color="#00ff00">but I wouldn't say</font>
<font color="#00ff00">they were exactly friends.</font>

917
00:53:14,480 --> 00:53:17,320
<font color="#ffff00">No. It seemed more like</font>
<font color="#ffff00">they were deadly enemies.</font>

918
00:53:18,880 --> 00:53:21,840
<font color="#00ffff">Without me,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">there would be no time travel.</font>

919
00:53:21,840 --> 00:53:25,920
<font color="#00ffff">You and our fellow Time Lords would</font>
<font color="#00ffff">still be locked in your own time,</font>

920
00:53:25,920 --> 00:53:29,960
<font color="#00ffff">as puny as those creatures</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you now so graciously protect.</font>

921
00:53:29,960 --> 00:53:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">You knew your mission was dangerous.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Dangerous, yes,</font>

922
00:53:33,320 --> 00:53:37,160
<font color="#00ffff">but I completed it. And I did not</font>
<font color="#00ffff">expect to be abandoned.</font>

923
00:53:37,160 --> 00:53:41,000
<font color="#00ffff">Many thousands of years ago</font>
<font color="#00ffff">when I left our planet,</font>

924
00:53:41,000 --> 00:53:43,280
<font color="#00ffff">all this was then a star,</font>

925
00:53:43,280 --> 00:53:45,680
<font color="#00ffff">until I arranged its detonation.</font>

926
00:53:45,680 --> 00:53:48,440
<font color="#ffffff">You were the solar engineer.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It was your duty.</font>

927
00:53:48,440 --> 00:53:51,280
<font color="#00ffff">It was an honour,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">or so I thought then.</font>

928
00:53:51,280 --> 00:53:55,160
<font color="#00ffff">I was to be the one to find</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and create the power source</font>

929
00:53:55,160 --> 00:53:57,520
<font color="#00ffff">that would give us mastery</font>
<font color="#00ffff">over time itself.</font>

930
00:53:57,520 --> 00:54:00,200
<font color="#ffffff">Well, you succeeded,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and are revered for it.</font>

931
00:54:00,200 --> 00:54:01,880
<font color="#00ffff">Revered? Here?</font>

932
00:54:01,880 --> 00:54:03,760
<font color="#00ffff">I was abandoned.</font>

933
00:54:03,760 --> 00:54:06,360
<font color="#ffffff">The histories say that you were</font>
<font color="#ffffff">lost in the supernova.</font>

934
00:54:06,360 --> 00:54:09,360
<font color="#00ffff">I was sacrificed to that supernova.</font>

935
00:54:09,360 --> 00:54:12,560
<font color="#00ffff">I generated those forces,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and for what?</font>

936
00:54:12,560 --> 00:54:16,040
<font color="#00ffff">To be blown out of existence into</font>
<font color="#00ffff">this black hole of anti-matter?</font>

937
00:54:16,040 --> 00:54:19,000
<font color="#00ffff">My brothers became Time Lords,</font>

938
00:54:19,000 --> 00:54:21,320
<font color="#00ffff">but I was abandoned and forgotten!</font>

939
00:54:21,320 --> 00:54:22,560
<font color="#ffffff">No.</font>

940
00:54:22,560 --> 00:54:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">No, not forgotten.</font>

941
00:54:24,200 --> 00:54:27,440
<font color="#ffffff">All my life I've known of you and</font>
<font color="#ffffff">honoured you as our greatest hero.</font>

942
00:54:27,440 --> 00:54:30,200
<font color="#00ffff">A hero?! I should have been a GOD!</font>

943
00:54:32,560 --> 00:54:35,280
<font color="#ffff00">Why would the creature</font>
<font color="#ffff00">bring the Doctor here</font>

944
00:54:35,280 --> 00:54:37,520
<font color="#ffff00">if they're deadly enemies?</font>

945
00:54:39,040 --> 00:54:41,280
<font color="#ffff00">Unless he means him</font>
<font color="#ffff00">some terrible harm!</font>

946
00:54:41,280 --> 00:54:43,920
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, come along, Jo.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Pull yourself together.</font>

947
00:54:43,920 --> 00:54:46,320
<font color="#00ff00">There's no point</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in getting worried about this.</font>

948
00:54:46,320 --> 00:54:48,640
<font color="#00ff00">We don't know that they're enemies.</font>

949
00:54:50,000 --> 00:54:53,080
<font color="#00ff00">In any case, I'm sure</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the Doctor knows what he's doing.</font>

950
00:54:55,160 --> 00:54:57,200
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I hope you're right.</font>

951
00:54:57,200 --> 00:55:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">Well, theoretically, of course,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">all this is quite impossible.</font>

952
00:55:00,280 --> 00:55:02,720
<font color="#00ffff">Here, Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">everything is possible.</font>

953
00:55:04,000 --> 00:55:05,800
<font color="#00ffff">Be seated.</font>

954
00:55:08,920 --> 00:55:10,760
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font>

955
00:55:11,840 --> 00:55:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me, how did you manage</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to survive?</font>

956
00:55:15,200 --> 00:55:17,440
<font color="#00ffff">How does anyone survive?</font>

957
00:55:17,440 --> 00:55:19,280
<font color="#00ffff">Force of will.</font>

958
00:55:19,280 --> 00:55:21,720
<font color="#00ffff">Mind, you might say,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">over anti-matter.</font>

959
00:55:23,640 --> 00:55:26,200
<font color="#ffffff">And this organism stuff</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that you sent to bring us here?</font>

960
00:55:26,200 --> 00:55:29,160
<font color="#00ffff">Created from the raw stuff</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of matter.</font>

961
00:55:29,160 --> 00:55:32,680
<font color="#00ffff">An organism that can exist</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in your world and mine.</font>

962
00:55:32,680 --> 00:55:35,320
<font color="#00ffff">It brought you here</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and imbued you with its properties</font>

963
00:55:35,320 --> 00:55:37,880
<font color="#00ffff">so that you too could exist</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in both worlds.</font>

964
00:55:37,880 --> 00:55:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">But how do I fit into this picture?</font>

965
00:55:40,000 --> 00:55:43,640
<font color="#00ffff">There are some things</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that even I cannot do, not alone.</font>

966
00:55:43,640 --> 00:55:45,480
<font color="#00ffff">And at this point in my plans,</font>

967
00:55:45,480 --> 00:55:47,920
<font color="#00ffff">I need the help</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of a brother Time Lord.</font>

968
00:55:47,920 --> 00:55:49,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I see.</font>

969
00:55:49,560 --> 00:55:52,400
<font color="#00ffff">And it pleases me</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to use you against them.</font>

970
00:55:53,480 --> 00:55:55,560
<font color="#ffffff">And if I give you my help,</font>

971
00:55:55,560 --> 00:55:59,400
<font color="#ffffff">do you really think you can defeat</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Time Lords? All of them?</font>

972
00:55:59,400 --> 00:56:01,720
<font color="#00ffff">But I am defeating them, Doctor.</font>

973
00:56:01,720 --> 00:56:05,560
<font color="#00ffff">All of their power is insufficient</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to prevent the cosmic energy drain</font>

974
00:56:05,560 --> 00:56:06,920
<font color="#00ffff">which I have caused.</font>

975
00:56:07,880 --> 00:56:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">And if I refuse to co-operate?</font>

976
00:56:10,240 --> 00:56:12,000
<font color="#00ffff">Then...</font>

977
00:56:12,000 --> 00:56:14,840
<font color="#00ffff">..you will face the wrath of Omega!</font>

978
00:56:14,840 --> 00:56:18,960
<font color="#00ffff">You and those miserable humans</font>
<font color="#00ffff">who accompany you.</font>

979
00:56:20,760 --> 00:56:22,800
<font color="#ffffff">COMMUNICATOR BEEPS</font>

980
00:56:26,240 --> 00:56:28,280
<font color="#ffffff">RAPID BEEPING</font>

981
00:56:31,400 --> 00:56:34,680
<font color="#00ffff">Investigate immediately,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">but do not harm them.</font>

982
00:56:37,880 --> 00:56:39,320
<font color="#ffffff">Them?</font>

983
00:56:39,320 --> 00:56:41,160
<font color="#00ffff">Well, Doctor,</font>

984
00:56:41,160 --> 00:56:43,680
<font color="#00ffff">it seems that we have more company.</font>

985
00:56:46,680 --> 00:56:48,720
<font color="#00ffff">Well, we appear to have arrived.</font>

986
00:56:50,040 --> 00:56:51,720
<font color="#ffff00">Corporal Palmer? Come in, Palmer.</font>

987
00:56:51,720 --> 00:56:54,040
<font color="#00ffff">I don't think you'll get through</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with that thing.</font>

988
00:56:54,040 --> 00:56:56,560
<font color="#ffff00">Why not?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">It hasn't quite got the range.</font>

989
00:56:56,560 --> 00:56:58,040
<font color="#ffff00">What are you talking about, Doctor?</font>

990
00:56:58,040 --> 00:57:00,280
<font color="#ffff00">They're only just outside</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the building.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Brigadier...</font>

991
00:57:00,280 --> 00:57:01,680
<font color="#ffff00">Corporal Palmer, do you read me?</font>

992
00:57:01,680 --> 00:57:03,920
<font color="#00ffff">..you should prepare yourself</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for a bit of a shock.</font>

993
00:57:03,920 --> 00:57:06,800
<font color="#00ff00">Can we take a look outside, Doc?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We can try.</font>

994
00:57:08,520 --> 00:57:11,320
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I never!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">It seems to have gone, sir.</font>

995
00:57:11,320 --> 00:57:13,600
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, it looks quiet enough.</font>

996
00:57:14,560 --> 00:57:17,240
<font color="#ffff00">Right, Doctor, if you'll open that</font>
<font color="#ffff00">door, I'll see what's going on.</font>

997
00:57:17,240 --> 00:57:19,560
<font color="#00ffff">I really wouldn't advise it!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, come along now, Doctor.</font>

998
00:57:19,560 --> 00:57:21,600
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, all right.</font>

999
00:57:21,600 --> 00:57:23,240
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, dear, oh, dear.</font>

1000
00:57:23,240 --> 00:57:26,440
<font color="#00ffff">I do wish he'd listen to me.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Come along. We'd better follow him.</font>

1001
00:57:32,160 --> 00:57:34,480
<font color="#00ffff">Well, that's extraordinary.</font>

1002
00:57:34,480 --> 00:57:37,560
<font color="#00ffff">That stuff must have found</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the TARDIS a bit indigestible</font>

1003
00:57:37,560 --> 00:57:39,240
<font color="#00ffff">even without the forcefield on,</font>

1004
00:57:39,240 --> 00:57:42,200
<font color="#00ffff">so it swallowed a bit of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the surrounding matter as well.</font>

1005
00:57:42,200 --> 00:57:45,680
<font color="#00ffff">Hmm. Rather like taking a pill</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with a swig of water.</font>

1006
00:57:45,680 --> 00:57:48,240
<font color="#ffff00">Well, they seem to have</font>
<font color="#ffff00">got rid of it.</font>

1007
00:57:48,240 --> 00:57:50,640
<font color="#ffff00">Benton, you...you stay here.</font>

1008
00:57:52,240 --> 00:57:54,360
<font color="#00ff00">So you think we've moved,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">is that it, Doc?</font>

1009
00:57:54,360 --> 00:57:55,760
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, I'm quite sure we have.</font>

1010
00:58:05,480 --> 00:58:07,960
<font color="#00ff00">Where do you reckon we are?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Not where he thinks we are.</font>

1011
00:58:07,960 --> 00:58:10,400
<font color="#ffff00">Now, see here, Doctor,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you have finally gone too far!</font>

1012
00:58:10,400 --> 00:58:13,320
<font color="#00ffff">I rather think we all have.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">What's it like out there?</font><font color="#ffff00"> There's...</font>

1013
00:58:13,320 --> 00:58:17,440
<font color="#ffff00">Well, there's sand everywhere!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, splendid! Who's for a swim?</font>

1014
00:58:17,440 --> 00:58:19,480
<font color="#ffff00">Do you realise what you've done?</font>

1015
00:58:19,480 --> 00:58:22,640
<font color="#ffff00">You've stolen the whole of UNIT HQ!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What am I going to tell Geneva?</font>

1016
00:58:22,640 --> 00:58:24,720
<font color="#ffff00">That the whole blessed building</font>
<font color="#ffff00">has been picked up</font>

1017
00:58:24,720 --> 00:58:26,280
<font color="#ffff00">and put down on a deserted beach?!</font>

1018
00:58:26,280 --> 00:58:27,960
<font color="#ffff00">We're probably miles from London!</font>

1019
00:58:27,960 --> 00:58:30,760
<font color="#00ffff">I'm afraid we're a little bit</font>
<font color="#00ffff">further than that, Brigadier.</font>

1020
00:58:30,760 --> 00:58:33,720
<font color="#ffff00">You mean we're not even</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in the same country?</font>

1021
00:58:37,880 --> 00:58:40,800
<font color="#ffff00">There will be</font>
<font color="#ffff00">international repercussions.</font>

1022
00:58:40,800 --> 00:58:43,040
<font color="#ffff00">This could be construed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as an invasion!</font>

1023
00:58:43,040 --> 00:58:45,280
<font color="#00ff00">It's not just a matter</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of the same country, sir.</font>

1024
00:58:45,280 --> 00:58:47,680
<font color="#00ff00">If the Doctor's right, we're not</font>
<font color="#00ff00">even in the same universe.</font>

1025
00:58:47,680 --> 00:58:49,120
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

1026
00:58:49,120 --> 00:58:51,560
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, nonsense, Benton. I tell you,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that's a beach out there.</font>

1027
00:58:51,560 --> 00:58:53,560
<font color="#ffff00">It's probably Norfolk,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">or somewhere like that.</font>

1028
00:58:53,560 --> 00:58:55,360
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, please, if you'd only listen...</font>

1029
00:58:55,360 --> 00:58:57,320
<font color="#ffff00">Right, now I'll tell you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">what we'll do.</font>

1030
00:58:57,320 --> 00:58:59,760
<font color="#ffff00">You two stay here,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">see that nobody wanders in.</font>

1031
00:58:59,760 --> 00:59:01,960
<font color="#ffff00">We can't have the place overrun</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with holiday-makers.</font>

1032
00:59:01,960 --> 00:59:03,160
<font color="#ffff00">I'll nip out, find a phone,</font>

1033
00:59:03,160 --> 00:59:05,480
<font color="#ffff00">and tell the authorities</font>
<font color="#ffff00">exactly where we are.</font>

1034
00:59:05,480 --> 00:59:08,160
<font color="#ffff00">I'm fairly sure that's Cromer.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Back in a jiff.</font>

1035
00:59:08,160 --> 00:59:11,160
<font color="#00ffff">Dear, oh, dear, oh, dear!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Let's go after him, Doc.</font>

1036
00:59:11,160 --> 00:59:13,480
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, I suppose we better had.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Just a minute.</font>

1037
00:59:13,480 --> 00:59:16,560
<font color="#00ffff">I think I'll have another look</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for my recorder.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Doctor...</font>

1038
00:59:16,560 --> 00:59:18,160
<font color="#00ff00">..when are you going to face</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the facts?</font>

1039
00:59:18,160 --> 00:59:19,960
<font color="#00ff00">You've lost your recorder</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and that's that.</font>

1040
00:59:19,960 --> 00:59:22,520
<font color="#00ffff">No, I'm sure it's in the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#00ffff">somewhere. I shan't be a minute.</font>

1041
00:59:22,520 --> 00:59:24,040
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor! Look!</font>

1042
00:59:24,040 --> 00:59:25,680
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, my giddy aunt!</font>

1043
00:59:27,120 --> 00:59:29,400
<font color="#00ffff">Ah!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Get back. Back!</font>

1044
00:59:41,440 --> 00:59:43,440
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Hey, you!</font>

1045
00:59:43,440 --> 00:59:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">Just a minute.</font>

1046
00:59:46,320 --> 00:59:48,920
<font color="#ffff00">Who are you?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Ollis.</font>

1047
00:59:48,920 --> 00:59:50,720
<font color="#ffffff">Game warden.</font>

1048
00:59:50,720 --> 00:59:54,600
<font color="#ffff00">Ollis? Yes, of course. The chap</font>
<font color="#ffff00">who found the balloon and vanished.</font>

1049
00:59:55,560 --> 00:59:57,320
<font color="#ffff00">Where are we? What's going on here?</font>

1050
00:59:57,320 --> 00:59:59,760
<font color="#ffffff">I thought you'd have told me that.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">They're your manoeuvres.</font>

1051
00:59:59,760 --> 01:00:02,280
<font color="#ffff00">No, Mr Ollis,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm as much in the dark as you are.</font>

1052
01:00:03,240 --> 01:00:06,120
<font color="#ffff00">Isn't there anything</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you can tell me?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Well...</font>

1053
01:00:06,120 --> 01:00:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">..there were two others in</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a daffy old motor car, for a start.</font>

1054
01:00:09,000 --> 01:00:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">A man and a girl.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">They went off after another fella,</font>

1055
01:00:11,400 --> 01:00:13,480
<font color="#ffffff">and all got took</font>
<font color="#ffffff">by those lovely creatures.</font>

1056
01:00:13,480 --> 01:00:16,760
<font color="#ffff00">What did the man look like?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Tall, fancy get-up, white hair.</font>

1057
01:00:17,960 --> 01:00:19,000
<font color="#ffff00">Yes.</font>

1058
01:00:21,240 --> 01:00:23,480
<font color="#ffff00">What happened to them?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I told you!</font>

1059
01:00:23,480 --> 01:00:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">They got took by those things.</font>

1060
01:00:25,440 --> 01:00:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">They didn't get me, though, cos I'm</font>
<font color="#ffffff">used to moving quiet, stalking them.</font>

1061
01:00:28,400 --> 01:00:30,840
<font color="#ffff00">Did you follow them?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I was just coming to that.</font>

1062
01:00:30,840 --> 01:00:32,480
<font color="#ffffff">Look out!</font>

1063
01:00:35,960 --> 01:00:39,160
<font color="#ffffff">That's them. Those things.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">That's what I meant.</font>

1064
01:00:41,040 --> 01:00:43,080
<font color="#ffff00">They've got the Doctor and Benton.</font>

1065
01:00:44,040 --> 01:00:46,160
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Hold on now!</font>

1066
01:00:46,160 --> 01:00:49,680
<font color="#ffffff">No use rushing them.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I know where they're bound.</font>

1067
01:00:51,640 --> 01:00:53,760
<font color="#ffffff">ORGANISMS GRUMBLE</font>

1068
01:01:10,120 --> 01:01:12,080
<font color="#ffffff">Now what, General?</font>

1069
01:01:14,080 --> 01:01:17,160
<font color="#ffff00">First we do a recce,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">then we mount a surprise attack.</font>

1070
01:01:18,120 --> 01:01:21,320
<font color="#ffff00">Mr Ollis, you will consider yourself</font>
<font color="#ffff00">under my orders.</font>

1071
01:01:25,960 --> 01:01:28,360
<font color="#ffffff">Look, if you cannot</font>
<font color="#ffffff">reverse the energy drain,</font>

1072
01:01:28,360 --> 01:01:31,200
<font color="#ffffff">the fabric of the entire universe</font>
<font color="#ffffff">could be torn apart.</font>

1073
01:01:31,200 --> 01:01:33,640
<font color="#00ffff">What if it is? It will make</font>
<font color="#00ffff">an interesting spectacle.</font>

1074
01:01:33,640 --> 01:01:37,280
<font color="#ffffff">Then you would be utterly alone</font>
<font color="#ffffff">forever.</font><font color="#00ffff"> I am used to solitude.</font>

1075
01:01:37,280 --> 01:01:40,760
<font color="#00ffff">And I shall have had my revenge.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I shall be satisfied.</font>

1076
01:01:40,760 --> 01:01:43,360
<font color="#ffffff">Omega, if you would undo</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the harm that you've done</font>

1077
01:01:43,360 --> 01:01:45,320
<font color="#ffffff">and resume your place</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in the High Council,</font>

1078
01:01:45,320 --> 01:01:47,520
<font color="#ffffff">you'd have the freedom</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to do anything that you wished.</font>

1079
01:01:47,520 --> 01:01:50,360
<font color="#00ffff">Power is the only freedom</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that I seek.</font>

1080
01:01:51,680 --> 01:01:54,960
<font color="#00ffff">Absolute power is absolute freedom.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No bargains.</font>

1081
01:01:56,400 --> 01:01:59,520
<font color="#00ffff">Especially not with those</font>
<font color="#00ffff">who betrayed and deserted me.</font>

1082
01:02:00,680 --> 01:02:03,600
<font color="#00ffff">No, Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you are here for a reason.</font>

1083
01:02:05,160 --> 01:02:07,160
<font color="#00ffff">Who are you?</font>

1084
01:02:07,160 --> 01:02:09,600
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, just some more</font>
<font color="#ffffff">innocent bystanders.</font>

1085
01:02:09,600 --> 01:02:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">Probably scooped up by</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that bungling organism of yours.</font>

1086
01:02:12,520 --> 01:02:15,920
<font color="#ffffff">Send them back, Omega.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">They can do you no harm.</font>

1087
01:02:15,920 --> 01:02:19,280
<font color="#00ffff">The organism was programmed</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to seek out a Time Lord.</font>

1088
01:02:19,280 --> 01:02:21,120
<font color="#ffffff">And it has done so.</font>

1089
01:02:21,120 --> 01:02:24,360
<font color="#00ffff">Can this,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">or this also be a Time Lord?</font>

1090
01:02:24,360 --> 01:02:27,160
<font color="#ffff00">Appearances aren't everything,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you know.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Ahh.</font>

1091
01:02:27,160 --> 01:02:29,840
<font color="#00ffff">You do not fear me.</font>

1092
01:02:34,160 --> 01:02:36,000
<font color="#00ffff">Can it be?</font>

1093
01:02:41,040 --> 01:02:43,080
<font color="#00ffff">Two Time Lords?</font>

1094
01:02:45,480 --> 01:02:46,560
<font color="#00ffff">Ha!</font>

1095
01:02:46,560 --> 01:02:49,080
<font color="#00ffff">The same Time Lord!</font>

1096
01:02:49,080 --> 01:02:51,480
<font color="#00ffff">The High Council</font>
<font color="#00ffff">must be desperate indeed</font>

1097
01:02:51,480 --> 01:02:53,280
<font color="#00ffff">to transgress the laws of time!</font>

1098
01:02:53,280 --> 01:02:56,080
<font color="#ffff00">I really think you're making</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a mistake.</font><font color="#00ffff"> You tried to trick me!</font>

1099
01:02:56,080 --> 01:02:58,200
<font color="#ffff00">I was out for a stroll</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with my friend here</font>

1100
01:02:58,200 --> 01:03:01,080
<font color="#ffff00">when this horrible great jelly...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">A pathetic attempt to deceive me!</font>

1101
01:03:01,080 --> 01:03:02,920
<font color="#ffffff">Omega...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Be silent!</font>

1102
01:03:02,920 --> 01:03:06,200
<font color="#00ffff">While I consider</font>
<font color="#00ffff">what shall be your fate.</font>

1103
01:03:08,160 --> 01:03:10,600
<font color="#ffff00">Is this really him? Omega?</font>

1104
01:03:10,600 --> 01:03:13,080
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I'm afraid so.</font>

1105
01:03:13,080 --> 01:03:15,160
<font color="#00ffff">You have angered me!</font>

1106
01:03:16,120 --> 01:03:18,040
<font color="#00ffff">You are facing death!</font>

1107
01:03:18,040 --> 01:03:19,680
<font color="#00ffff">Take them away!</font>

1108
01:03:19,680 --> 01:03:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">THUNDER RUMBLES</font>

1109
01:03:35,000 --> 01:03:37,520
<font color="#ffff00">Did you find a way in?</font><font color="#ffffff"> No. You?</font><font color="#ffff00"> No.</font>

1110
01:03:37,520 --> 01:03:39,120
<font color="#ffff00">There's only one thing for it.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Eh?</font>

1111
01:03:39,120 --> 01:03:41,360
<font color="#ffff00">Wait till the door opens</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and take them by storm.</font>

1112
01:03:41,360 --> 01:03:44,040
<font color="#ffff00">Full-scale frontal attack</font>
<font color="#ffff00">using all the resources available.</font>

1113
01:03:44,040 --> 01:03:47,160
<font color="#ffffff">What does that mean?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">That, Mr Ollis, means you and me.</font>

1114
01:03:47,160 --> 01:03:48,760
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>

1115
01:03:51,960 --> 01:03:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">I tell you, I practically had him</font>
<font color="#ffffff">won over, then you turned up</font>

1116
01:03:54,480 --> 01:03:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">and he treated me like an impostor!</font>

1117
01:03:56,000 --> 01:03:58,520
<font color="#00ffff">Well, you are really, aren't you?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean?</font>

1118
01:03:58,520 --> 01:04:00,560
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I suppose, in another way,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we both are.</font>

1119
01:04:00,560 --> 01:04:02,600
<font color="#00ffff">Or is it neither of us?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, stop twittering on!</font>

1120
01:04:02,600 --> 01:04:04,280
<font color="#00ffff">There's no need to be offensive!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not!</font>

1121
01:04:04,280 --> 01:04:06,680
<font color="#ffff00">Here they go again!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">You're supposed to help one another.</font>

1122
01:04:06,680 --> 01:04:09,320
<font color="#ffff00">That was the idea.</font>

1123
01:04:09,320 --> 01:04:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, all right. Well, I'm sorry.</font>

1124
01:04:11,000 --> 01:04:13,000
<font color="#ffffff">Perhaps I did speak</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a trifle sharply.</font>

1125
01:04:13,000 --> 01:04:15,880
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, well, I'm... I'm sorry too.</font>

1126
01:04:16,840 --> 01:04:18,200
<font color="#00ffff">Well...</font>

1127
01:04:19,160 --> 01:04:20,800
<font color="#00ffff">..what did you think of this chap</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Omega?</font>

1128
01:04:20,800 --> 01:04:22,760
<font color="#ffffff">Frankly, I thought</font>
<font color="#ffffff">he was somewhat confused.</font>

1129
01:04:22,760 --> 01:04:25,200
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, and I'm somewhat confused.</font>

1130
01:04:25,200 --> 01:04:27,320
<font color="#00ff00">Who's he?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">BOTH: Me.</font>

1131
01:04:27,320 --> 01:04:30,320
<font color="#00ff00">I beg your pardon?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, ask Jo, there's a good chap.</font>

1132
01:04:30,320 --> 01:04:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">See, one minute he was talking</font>
<font color="#ffffff">about destroying everything.</font>

1133
01:04:34,080 --> 01:04:36,080
<font color="#ffffff">The next minute, he's talking</font>
<font color="#ffffff">about freedom.</font>

1134
01:04:36,080 --> 01:04:37,840
<font color="#00ff00">Look, if this is</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a world of anti-matter,</font>

1135
01:04:37,840 --> 01:04:41,080
<font color="#00ff00">how can it all exist?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">BOTH: The phenomenon of singularity.</font>

1136
01:04:41,080 --> 01:04:42,760
<font color="#00ff00">Singularity?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Look, you explain to him.</font>

1137
01:04:42,760 --> 01:04:44,640
<font color="#ffffff">You're far better at it than I am.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No, no, no.</font>

1138
01:04:44,640 --> 01:04:47,360
<font color="#00ffff">Please. Older and wiser head.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Singularity.</font>

1139
01:04:47,360 --> 01:04:48,760
<font color="#00ff00">Now I know it's supposed to exist.</font>

1140
01:04:48,760 --> 01:04:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, well, it does exist.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Right here, I'm afraid.</font>

1141
01:04:50,840 --> 01:04:52,600
<font color="#00ff00">But that's just a theory.</font>

1142
01:04:52,600 --> 01:04:54,560
<font color="#ffff00">Look, Doctors,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">what ARE you talking about?</font>

1143
01:04:54,560 --> 01:04:56,680
<font color="#ffff00">In simple answers, please.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Well...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Jo...</font>

1144
01:04:56,680 --> 01:04:58,920
<font color="#ffff00">One at a time this time!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Well...</font><font color="#00ffff"> What...</font>

1145
01:05:00,840 --> 01:05:03,200
<font color="#00ffff">Well, singularity</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is a point in space time</font>

1146
01:05:03,200 --> 01:05:05,360
<font color="#00ffff">which can exist</font>
<font color="#00ffff">only inside a black hole.</font>

1147
01:05:05,360 --> 01:05:07,280
<font color="#00ffff">We are in a black hole.</font>

1148
01:05:07,280 --> 01:05:10,240
<font color="#00ffff">In a world of anti-matter very</font>
<font color="#00ffff">close to this point of singularity</font>

1149
01:05:10,240 --> 01:05:12,680
<font color="#00ffff">where all the known physical laws</font>
<font color="#00ffff">cease to exist.</font>

1150
01:05:12,680 --> 01:05:15,960
<font color="#00ffff">Now, Omega has got control</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of singularity</font>

1151
01:05:15,960 --> 01:05:18,200
<font color="#00ffff">and has learned</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to use the vast forces locked up</font>

1152
01:05:18,200 --> 01:05:19,320
<font color="#00ffff">inside the black hole.</font>

1153
01:05:19,320 --> 01:05:22,440
<font color="#ffffff">That is how Omega was able to create</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the world we're now living in</font>

1154
01:05:22,440 --> 01:05:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">by a fantastic effort of his will.</font>

1155
01:05:24,200 --> 01:05:26,760
<font color="#ffffff">Unfortunately, he thinks he's been</font>
<font color="#ffffff">wronged by the Time Lords.</font>

1156
01:05:26,760 --> 01:05:29,720
<font color="#00ff00">Time Lords?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">And now he's hellbent on revenge.</font>

1157
01:05:29,720 --> 01:05:32,400
<font color="#ffff00">Well, you'll just have to stop him,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">won't you?</font>

1158
01:05:32,400 --> 01:05:35,840
<font color="#00ffff">Well, the trouble is</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we're not sure we can.</font>

1159
01:05:40,760 --> 01:05:44,000
<font color="#00ff00">Well, who is this Omega anyway?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">A Time Lord.</font>

1160
01:05:44,000 --> 01:05:47,520
<font color="#ffffff">One of the greatest of all my race.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Our race.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Our race. Sorry.</font>

1161
01:05:47,520 --> 01:05:51,040
<font color="#00ffff">Long, long ago, we learned</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the secret of time travel.</font>

1162
01:05:52,040 --> 01:05:53,560
<font color="#00ffff">But in order to make it a reality,</font>

1163
01:05:53,560 --> 01:05:55,560
<font color="#00ffff">we had to have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a colossal source of energy.</font>

1164
01:05:55,560 --> 01:05:57,880
<font color="#ffffff">Omega provided that energy</font>
<font color="#ffffff">by a fantastic feat</font>

1165
01:05:57,880 --> 01:06:00,600
<font color="#ffffff">of solar engineering.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We thought he was destroyed,</font>

1166
01:06:00,600 --> 01:06:02,640
<font color="#ffffff">instead of which,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">he finished up here.</font>

1167
01:06:02,640 --> 01:06:05,120
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, it seems his imprisonment</font>
<font color="#00ffff">was the price of our freedom</font>

1168
01:06:05,120 --> 01:06:06,200
<font color="#00ffff">to travel in time.</font>

1169
01:06:07,160 --> 01:06:10,880
<font color="#ffff00">Even so, you can't let him</font>
<font color="#ffff00">smash everything up.</font>

1170
01:06:10,880 --> 01:06:13,400
<font color="#ffff00">Well, look,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">he's not all-powerful, you know.</font>

1171
01:06:14,360 --> 01:06:16,720
<font color="#ffff00">Or else why did he need</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to bring you here?</font>

1172
01:06:16,720 --> 01:06:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, that's true.</font>

1173
01:06:18,800 --> 01:06:21,120
<font color="#00ff00">There must be something you can do</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to get us out of here.</font>

1174
01:06:21,120 --> 01:06:23,360
<font color="#ffff00">What about your sonic screwdriver?</font>

1175
01:06:23,360 --> 01:06:25,480
<font color="#ffffff">No. It's useless in this world.</font>

1176
01:06:25,480 --> 01:06:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">The only natural law here</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is the law of Omega's will.</font>

1177
01:06:29,400 --> 01:06:31,240
<font color="#ffff00">Omega's...</font>

1178
01:06:31,240 --> 01:06:36,040
<font color="#ffff00">Look, if Omega can will up</font>
<font color="#ffff00">an entire world,</font>

1179
01:06:36,040 --> 01:06:39,600
<font color="#ffff00">well, surely you two</font>
<font color="#ffff00">could will up a small door.</font>

1180
01:06:39,600 --> 01:06:43,040
<font color="#00ffff">Hmm?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Well, look, you're a Time Lord,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">aren't you?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>

1181
01:06:43,040 --> 01:06:45,160
<font color="#ffff00">In fact, you're two Time Lords.</font>

1182
01:06:45,160 --> 01:06:48,360
<font color="#ffff00">Well, surely your wills combined</font>
<font color="#ffff00">are a match for his?</font>

1183
01:06:49,320 --> 01:06:52,320
<font color="#ffff00">Why else do you think the High</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Council wanted the two of you here?</font>

1184
01:06:53,280 --> 01:06:55,320
<font color="#ffffff">It might work. It just might.</font>

1185
01:06:55,320 --> 01:06:57,200
<font color="#00ffff">It's worth a try.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font>

1186
01:06:58,160 --> 01:06:59,680
<font color="#00ffff">Right!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Right.</font>

1187
01:06:59,680 --> 01:07:01,440
<font color="#00ffff">Ready?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Ready.</font>

1188
01:07:02,600 --> 01:07:04,400
<font color="#00ffff">Contact.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Contact.</font>

1189
01:07:11,800 --> 01:07:13,720
<font color="#ffff00">It's working!</font>

1190
01:07:18,720 --> 01:07:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">Well done!</font><font color="#00ffff"> I couldn't possibly</font>
<font color="#00ffff">have done it without you.</font>

1191
01:07:21,640 --> 01:07:23,800
<font color="#00ffff">What next?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Singularity chamber.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Splendid!</font>

1192
01:07:23,800 --> 01:07:26,240
<font color="#ffffff">That's the key to it all.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font><font color="#ffff00"> But...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Jo!</font>

1193
01:07:26,240 --> 01:07:29,720
<font color="#ffffff">You wait there.</font><font color="#00ffff"> It even opens!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Singularity chamber!</font>

1194
01:07:29,720 --> 01:07:32,440
<font color="#00ff00">Can't miss that.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Chance of a lifetime!</font>

1195
01:07:32,440 --> 01:07:34,680
<font color="#ffff00">That's charming.</font><font color="#00ff00"> I'm not just</font>
<font color="#00ff00">going to sit here</font>

1196
01:07:34,680 --> 01:07:36,640
<font color="#00ff00">while they have all the fun.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Neither am I.</font>

1197
01:07:36,640 --> 01:07:38,680
<font color="#00ff00">Come on!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Come on, Sergeant Benton.</font>

1198
01:08:04,960 --> 01:08:06,640
<font color="#00ff00">Through here!</font>

1199
01:08:39,520 --> 01:08:41,640
<font color="#00ffff">Well? Shall we?</font>

1200
01:08:41,640 --> 01:08:43,720
<font color="#ffffff">The bull by the horns, eh?</font>

1201
01:08:44,920 --> 01:08:46,760
<font color="#00ffff">All right.</font>

1202
01:08:49,360 --> 01:08:51,200
<font color="#ffffff">Well, after you.</font>

1203
01:08:52,960 --> 01:08:54,640
<font color="#00ffff">Let's toss, shall we?</font>

1204
01:08:57,360 --> 01:08:59,400
<font color="#ffffff">What would be the point?</font>

1205
01:09:11,960 --> 01:09:13,800
<font color="#ffffff">Singularity.</font>

1206
01:09:13,800 --> 01:09:15,440
<font color="#ffff00">Fascinating.</font>

1207
01:09:17,040 --> 01:09:18,920
<font color="#00ffff">What?!</font>

1208
01:09:20,120 --> 01:09:22,160
<font color="#00ffff">How is it that you are free?</font>

1209
01:09:22,160 --> 01:09:24,880
<font color="#ffffff">By combining our wills</font>
<font color="#ffffff">against yours.</font>

1210
01:09:24,880 --> 01:09:27,960
<font color="#ffff00">Together we were able</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to break down your barriers,</font>

1211
01:09:27,960 --> 01:09:30,520
<font color="#ffff00">so you're not all-powerful</font>
<font color="#ffff00">after all, Omega!</font>

1212
01:09:30,520 --> 01:09:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">But if you free us, we'll plead</font>
<font color="#ffffff">your cause to the Time Lords.</font>

1213
01:09:34,320 --> 01:09:37,480
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise, we shall</font>
<font color="#ffffff">combine our wills to destroy you.</font>

1214
01:09:37,480 --> 01:09:40,560
<font color="#00ffff">You dare threaten to destroy me?!</font>

1215
01:09:40,560 --> 01:09:43,000
<font color="#00ffff">You wish to fight</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the will of Omega?!</font>

1216
01:09:43,000 --> 01:09:45,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, if I must.</font>

1217
01:09:45,240 --> 01:09:47,280
<font color="#00ffff">Then you shall!</font>

1218
01:09:48,240 --> 01:09:52,360
<font color="#00ffff">But you will fight</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the dark side of my mind.</font>

1219
01:09:54,760 --> 01:09:57,680
<font color="#00ffff">The dark side of my mind!</font>

1220
01:10:10,120 --> 01:10:12,160
<font color="#00ff00">It's no good.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">It all looks the same.</font>

1221
01:10:12,160 --> 01:10:15,280
<font color="#00ffff">We can't just stay here.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">They're right behind us.</font>

1222
01:10:15,280 --> 01:10:16,920
<font color="#00ff00">This way.</font>

1223
01:10:19,560 --> 01:10:21,400
<font color="#00ff00">They're everywhere!</font>

1224
01:10:21,400 --> 01:10:23,840
<font color="#00ffff">Let's try down here.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, come on.</font>

1225
01:10:29,360 --> 01:10:31,400
<font color="#00ff00">It's no good. We're lost.</font>

1226
01:10:31,400 --> 01:10:34,200
<font color="#00ffff">Well, we can't just</font>
<font color="#00ffff">give ourselves up.</font>

1227
01:10:34,200 --> 01:10:37,520
<font color="#00ff00">Agreed. What do we do?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Let's try this way.</font>

1228
01:10:38,480 --> 01:10:40,720
<font color="#ffff00">Here. Look what I found.</font>

1229
01:10:40,720 --> 01:10:42,040
<font color="#00ff00">Great. How can that help us?</font>

1230
01:10:42,040 --> 01:10:44,000
<font color="#ffff00">It's the corridor</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to the main entrance!</font>

1231
01:10:44,000 --> 01:10:46,240
<font color="#ffff00">Come on!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Yes.</font>

1232
01:10:51,760 --> 01:10:54,760
<font color="#00ff00">Dr Tyler, give me a hand with this!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Quickly! They're coming!</font>

1233
01:10:55,720 --> 01:10:57,600
<font color="#00ff00">Out! Make for the hill!</font>

1234
01:10:58,800 --> 01:11:00,840
<font color="#ffffff">WEAPONS FIRE</font>

1235
01:11:29,280 --> 01:11:32,280
<font color="#00ff00">How did you...? How did you know</font>
<font color="#00ff00">we were trying to get out?</font>

1236
01:11:32,280 --> 01:11:33,840
<font color="#00ffff">We didn't. We were trying to get in.</font>

1237
01:11:33,840 --> 01:11:35,960
<font color="#00ffff">Was the Doctor with you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">when you came here?</font>

1238
01:11:35,960 --> 01:11:38,400
<font color="#ffff00">Yes. Of course, sir.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Well, he can't</font>
<font color="#00ffff">have been. He was with me.</font>

1239
01:11:38,400 --> 01:11:40,120
<font color="#00ff00">Sir, look over there!</font>

1240
01:11:42,400 --> 01:11:45,400
<font color="#00ffff">Come on! It's just over the dune!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What is?</font>

1241
01:12:27,720 --> 01:12:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">Well, what do you want now?</font>

1242
01:12:29,120 --> 01:12:31,440
<font color="#00ffff">Energy level is dangerously low,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor.</font>

1243
01:12:31,440 --> 01:12:33,600
<font color="#00ffff">You are our last chance.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You must go in.</font>

1244
01:12:33,600 --> 01:12:36,840
<font color="#ffffff">In?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">A black hole.</font>

1245
01:12:36,840 --> 01:12:39,680
<font color="#00ffff">I repeat, you are our last chance.</font>

1246
01:12:39,680 --> 01:12:42,280
<font color="#00ffff">All three are needed</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to defeat Omega.</font>

1247
01:12:43,360 --> 01:12:45,920
<font color="#00ffff">We will use the last of our energy</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to send you through.</font>

1248
01:12:47,080 --> 01:12:50,560
<font color="#ffffff">Well, better than being stuck here,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I suppose. All right.</font>

1249
01:13:33,160 --> 01:13:37,640
<font color="#00ffff">Those who oppose the will</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of Omega shall not live!</font>

1250
01:13:37,640 --> 01:13:39,040
<font color="#00ffff">Destroy him!</font>

1251
01:13:39,040 --> 01:13:40,960
<font color="#ffff00">No, Omega!</font>

1252
01:13:40,960 --> 01:13:43,920
<font color="#ffff00">Destroy him and you'll destroy</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your only chance of freedom.</font>

1253
01:13:56,400 --> 01:13:58,640
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, Omega.</font>

1254
01:13:58,640 --> 01:14:00,560
<font color="#ffffff">A most interesting demonstration.</font>

1255
01:14:00,560 --> 01:14:02,160
<font color="#00ffff">Be warned.</font>

1256
01:14:02,160 --> 01:14:03,840
<font color="#00ffff">You have seen my power.</font>

1257
01:14:03,840 --> 01:14:07,280
<font color="#00ffff">You and your friends will learn that</font>
<font color="#00ffff">it is useless to defy me.</font>

1258
01:14:07,280 --> 01:14:09,760
<font color="#ffff00">But our friends do not defy you.</font>

1259
01:14:09,760 --> 01:14:11,080
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, yes.</font>

1260
01:14:11,080 --> 01:14:12,960
<font color="#00ffff">They too are trying to escape.</font>

1261
01:14:20,120 --> 01:14:21,800
<font color="#ffff00">Where are we going?</font>

1262
01:14:21,800 --> 01:14:23,480
<font color="#00ffff">UNIT HQ.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What?!</font>

1263
01:14:23,480 --> 01:14:25,560
<font color="#00ffff">It's nearer than you think.</font>

1264
01:14:27,160 --> 01:14:29,720
<font color="#ffffff">All this exists because</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you have willed singularity</font>

1265
01:14:29,720 --> 01:14:31,280
<font color="#ffffff">to create it all for you.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Exactly.</font>

1266
01:14:31,280 --> 01:14:34,800
<font color="#ffff00">I say, you mean all you've got to do</font>
<font color="#ffff00">is think of a thing,</font>

1267
01:14:34,800 --> 01:14:36,280
<font color="#ffff00">rub your magic lamp over there,</font>

1268
01:14:36,280 --> 01:14:38,400
<font color="#ffff00">and shally-me-gally-me-zoop,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">there it is?</font>

1269
01:14:38,400 --> 01:14:41,160
<font color="#ffff00">That's jolly clever.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">That's jolly clever!</font>

1270
01:14:41,160 --> 01:14:44,480
<font color="#00ffff">Are you sure that you and he</font>
<font color="#00ffff">are of the same intelligence?</font>

1271
01:14:44,480 --> 01:14:46,600
<font color="#ffff00">You couldn't run me up a quick</font>
<font color="#ffff00">recorder, could you?</font>

1272
01:14:46,600 --> 01:14:49,200
<font color="#ffff00">It's a little thing about this long</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with holes. I've lost mine.</font>

1273
01:14:49,200 --> 01:14:51,000
<font color="#00ffff">I'll tell you the task</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that lies before you.</font>

1274
01:14:51,000 --> 01:14:52,680
<font color="#ffff00">It's not much to ask,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a small recorder!</font>

1275
01:14:52,680 --> 01:14:54,880
<font color="#00ffff">Silence!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Please ignore him.</font>

1276
01:14:54,880 --> 01:14:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Just ignore him.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">He's incorrigibly frivolous.</font>

1277
01:14:57,000 --> 01:14:58,880
<font color="#ffff00">Just because you're not musical.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Please.</font>

1278
01:14:58,880 --> 01:15:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">Will you stop interrupting?</font>

1279
01:15:01,560 --> 01:15:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">Continue.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Continue?</font>

1280
01:15:03,680 --> 01:15:05,880
<font color="#00ffff">While you play stupid</font>
<font color="#00ffff">childish games?</font>

1281
01:15:05,880 --> 01:15:08,040
<font color="#00ffff">You face annihilation,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">do you know that?</font>

1282
01:15:08,040 --> 01:15:11,360
<font color="#00ffff">You, your entire race, your precious</font>
<font color="#00ffff">terrestrials, everything.</font>

1283
01:15:11,360 --> 01:15:14,680
<font color="#00ffff">And what do you do?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You wrangle and babble of pipes.</font>

1284
01:15:14,680 --> 01:15:17,720
<font color="#ffff00">It's not a pipe!</font><font color="#ffffff"> What the hell</font>
<font color="#ffffff">do you think you're trying to do?</font>

1285
01:15:17,720 --> 01:15:19,560
<font color="#ffff00">Testing the limits</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of his self-control.</font>

1286
01:15:19,560 --> 01:15:21,640
<font color="#ffff00">They're not very good, are they?</font>

1287
01:15:21,640 --> 01:15:23,400
<font color="#ffffff">No. No, they're not.</font>

1288
01:15:23,400 --> 01:15:25,560
<font color="#ffffff">But it'll be dangerous</font>
<font color="#ffffff">if we push him too far.</font>

1289
01:15:25,560 --> 01:15:28,400
<font color="#ffff00">We'll have to risk that.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">That temper is his only weakness.</font>

1290
01:15:28,400 --> 01:15:30,840
<font color="#00ffff">What are you saying?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Do you plot against me?</font>

1291
01:15:30,840 --> 01:15:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">No, no, I was just explaining</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to my associate here</font>

1292
01:15:33,040 --> 01:15:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">that he should show you more</font>
<font color="#ffffff">respect, for both our sakes.</font>

1293
01:15:35,400 --> 01:15:40,080
<font color="#ffff00">I am thoroughly repentant.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">You mentioned some task.</font>

1294
01:15:40,080 --> 01:15:46,840
<font color="#00ffff">Yes. I created this world</font>
<font color="#00ffff">through the power of my will.</font>

1295
01:15:46,840 --> 01:15:49,840
<font color="#00ffff">I created the organisms</font>
<font color="#00ffff">which brought you here.</font>

1296
01:15:51,280 --> 01:15:56,440
<font color="#00ffff">This is the source of the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">light stream you travelled along,</font>

1297
01:15:56,440 --> 01:16:00,280
<font color="#00ffff">and I created it. I alone!</font>

1298
01:16:00,280 --> 01:16:02,240
<font color="#00ffff">Omega!</font>

1299
01:16:03,320 --> 01:16:06,720
<font color="#00ffff">And it is not enough.</font>

1300
01:16:08,680 --> 01:16:11,440
<font color="#00ffff">None of it is enough.</font>

1301
01:16:11,440 --> 01:16:14,040
<font color="#00ffff">I am still trapped,</font>

1302
01:16:14,040 --> 01:16:17,840
<font color="#00ffff">as trapped as I was the moment</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I arrived in this...</font>

1303
01:16:17,840 --> 01:16:20,760
<font color="#00ffff">..this desolation. Huh.</font>

1304
01:16:22,440 --> 01:16:24,280
<font color="#00ffff">Ironic, is it not?</font>

1305
01:16:24,280 --> 01:16:27,000
<font color="#ffff00">But surely, if you can transmit</font>
<font color="#ffff00">matter to Earth</font>

1306
01:16:27,000 --> 01:16:30,560
<font color="#ffff00">down that light stream, you could</font>
<font color="#ffff00">transmit yourself anywhere.</font>

1307
01:16:30,560 --> 01:16:33,200
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, so I imagined.</font>

1308
01:16:33,200 --> 01:16:36,560
<font color="#00ffff">But no, there was no way out.</font>

1309
01:16:36,560 --> 01:16:38,560
<font color="#00ffff">No escape.</font>

1310
01:16:38,560 --> 01:16:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">But why?</font>

1311
01:16:40,000 --> 01:16:46,440
<font color="#00ffff">So long as I control singularity,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I can make it do my will.</font>

1312
01:16:46,440 --> 01:16:52,640
<font color="#00ffff">All these things exist</font>
<font color="#00ffff">because I will them to exist.</font>

1313
01:16:52,640 --> 01:16:57,520
<font color="#00ffff">Without me and the unceasing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">pressure of my will,</font>

1314
01:16:57,520 --> 01:17:01,560
<font color="#00ffff">the work of thousands of years</font>
<font color="#00ffff">would collapse into chaos</font>

1315
01:17:01,560 --> 01:17:03,320
<font color="#00ffff">in microseconds.</font>

1316
01:17:03,320 --> 01:17:08,920
<font color="#00ffff">I am, if you like,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the Atlas of my world.</font>

1317
01:17:10,040 --> 01:17:14,200
<font color="#ffffff">So the moment you abandon control,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you cannot escape,</font>

1318
01:17:14,200 --> 01:17:17,160
<font color="#ffffff">and you cannot escape</font>
<font color="#ffffff">without abandoning control.</font>

1319
01:17:17,160 --> 01:17:22,040
<font color="#00ffff">Exactly. I am a prisoner of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">my own power, my own creation.</font>

1320
01:17:22,040 --> 01:17:25,760
<font color="#00ffff">Or rather, I was, until now.</font>

1321
01:17:27,200 --> 01:17:30,040
<font color="#00ffff">And that is your task -</font>

1322
01:17:30,040 --> 01:17:35,040
<font color="#00ffff">to take over my burden</font>
<font color="#00ffff">so that I may escape.</font>

1323
01:17:46,600 --> 01:17:47,920
<font color="#00ffff">Well?</font>

1324
01:17:49,920 --> 01:17:51,240
<font color="#00ffff">Your answer?</font>

1325
01:17:53,240 --> 01:17:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">We will obey you, Omega.</font>

1326
01:17:54,480 --> 01:17:55,840
<font color="#ffff00">We have no choice.</font>

1327
01:17:57,640 --> 01:18:01,160
<font color="#00ffff">Then you will help me</font>
<font color="#00ffff">make my preparations.</font>

1328
01:18:01,160 --> 01:18:04,760
<font color="#00ffff">You must first remove this mask.</font>

1329
01:18:04,760 --> 01:18:07,440
<font color="#00ffff">Now you, too, will need such masks.</font>

1330
01:18:07,440 --> 01:18:10,000
<font color="#00ffff">The light stream has a slow,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">corrosive effect</font>

1331
01:18:10,000 --> 01:18:12,480
<font color="#00ffff">due to the acceleration of the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">particles,</font>

1332
01:18:12,480 --> 01:18:14,680
<font color="#00ffff">but you are in no immediate danger.</font>

1333
01:18:14,680 --> 01:18:17,560
<font color="#00ffff">The process takes time.</font>

1334
01:18:18,760 --> 01:18:20,280
<font color="#00ffff">Come, the mask.</font>

1335
01:18:30,520 --> 01:18:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">MASK CREAKS</font>

1336
01:18:37,040 --> 01:18:39,000
<font color="#00ffff">What is it?</font>

1337
01:18:39,000 --> 01:18:41,640
<font color="#00ffff">Why do you not obey me?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Take off the mask!</font>

1338
01:18:45,480 --> 01:18:47,640
<font color="#00ffff">What are you doing?</font>

1339
01:18:47,640 --> 01:18:49,880
<font color="#00ffff">I am in haste to be gone.</font>

1340
01:18:49,880 --> 01:18:51,320
<font color="#ffff00">We...</font>

1341
01:18:51,320 --> 01:18:55,720
<font color="#ffff00">We cannot remove the mask, Omega,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">because...</font>

1342
01:18:55,720 --> 01:18:58,640
<font color="#ffffff">Because beneath that mask,</font>

1343
01:18:58,640 --> 01:19:00,880
<font color="#ffffff">there is nothing left of you.</font>

1344
01:19:00,880 --> 01:19:02,880
<font color="#ffffff">Corrosion has already done its work.</font>

1345
01:19:02,880 --> 01:19:04,240
<font color="#00ffff">What?!</font>

1346
01:19:08,800 --> 01:19:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">You exist only because your will</font>
<font color="#ffffff">insists that you exist.</font>

1347
01:19:13,680 --> 01:19:16,080
<font color="#ffffff">Your will is all that is left</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of you.</font>

1348
01:19:21,320 --> 01:19:23,960
<font color="#ffffff">HE HOWLS</font>

1349
01:19:28,360 --> 01:19:32,440
<font color="#00ffff">It is not true!</font>

1350
01:19:34,840 --> 01:19:40,080
<font color="#00ffff">I am Omega,</font>

1351
01:19:40,080 --> 01:19:44,520
<font color="#00ffff">creator of this world!</font>

1352
01:19:45,560 --> 01:19:51,080
<font color="#00ffff">And I can also destroy.</font>

1353
01:19:51,080 --> 01:19:55,560
<font color="#00ffff">Therefore I must exist.</font>

1354
01:19:55,560 --> 01:19:58,560
<font color="#ffff00">Don't you see?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">You can only exist here.</font>

1355
01:19:58,560 --> 01:20:03,160
<font color="#00ffff">If I exist only by my will,</font>

1356
01:20:03,160 --> 01:20:08,640
<font color="#00ffff">then my will is to destroy,</font>

1357
01:20:08,640 --> 01:20:13,400
<font color="#00ffff">and all things shall be destroyed.</font>

1358
01:20:13,400 --> 01:20:18,160
<font color="#00ffff">All things! All things!</font>

1359
01:20:21,640 --> 01:20:27,040
<font color="#00ffff">All things! All things!</font>

1360
01:20:27,040 --> 01:20:29,600
<font color="#ffff00">I told you he's got no self-control.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Come on, out.</font>

1361
01:20:36,920 --> 01:20:39,120
<font color="#00ffff">Brigadier, mind that rock.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Watch out. Watch it.</font>

1362
01:20:39,120 --> 01:20:41,760
<font color="#ffffff">There it is, over there.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">How did it get there?</font>

1363
01:20:41,760 --> 01:20:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">A very good question, Miss Grant.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font>

1364
01:20:55,240 --> 01:20:57,680
<font color="#ffffff">That's funny.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I could've sworn I left Bessie here.</font>

1365
01:20:57,680 --> 01:20:59,920
<font color="#ffff00">You did, old chap.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Tracks are leading that way.</font>

1366
01:20:59,920 --> 01:21:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">That's Jo and Benton.</font><font color="#ffff00"> They'll be</font>
<font color="#ffff00">making for UNIT headquarters.</font>

1367
01:21:02,680 --> 01:21:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font>

1368
01:21:03,840 --> 01:21:05,960
<font color="#ffffff">Come on, let's get a move on.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh!</font>

1369
01:21:11,040 --> 01:21:13,880
<font color="#ffffff">THEY ARGUE</font>

1370
01:21:15,520 --> 01:21:18,120
<font color="#ffffff">Just one moment, if you please.</font>

1371
01:21:18,120 --> 01:21:19,720
<font color="#ffffff">Now, wait a moment.</font>

1372
01:21:19,720 --> 01:21:21,560
<font color="#ffffff">We may be in a somewhat unusual</font>
<font color="#ffffff">situation,</font>

1373
01:21:21,560 --> 01:21:24,960
<font color="#ffffff">but you two at least are still</font>
<font color="#ffffff">supposed to be members of UNIT.</font>

1374
01:21:24,960 --> 01:21:26,720
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, sir.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, sir. I'm sorry, sir.</font>

1375
01:21:26,720 --> 01:21:29,320
<font color="#ffffff">The question is this.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What offensive action should we</font>

1376
01:21:29,320 --> 01:21:31,560
<font color="#ffffff">or indeed can we take</font>
<font color="#ffffff">against this chap Omega?</font>

1377
01:21:31,560 --> 01:21:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">Now, in the absence of the Doctors,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">it seems to me...</font><font color="#00ffff"> Sir, listen.</font>

1378
01:21:34,520 --> 01:21:37,760
<font color="#ffffff">GUNS FIRE</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Sounds like a full-scale attack.</font>

1379
01:21:37,760 --> 01:21:39,880
<font color="#ffff00">Maybe they're not firing at us.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Maybe...</font>

1380
01:21:39,880 --> 01:21:41,800
<font color="#ffff00">It's the Doctors!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Open the door. Quick.</font>

1381
01:21:41,800 --> 01:21:43,720
<font color="#ffff00">Quickly, come on.</font>

1382
01:21:45,520 --> 01:21:48,160
<font color="#ffff00">TARDIS, everybody. Into the TARDIS.</font>

1383
01:21:48,160 --> 01:21:50,480
<font color="#ffff00">Quickly.</font>

1384
01:21:54,480 --> 01:21:56,760
<font color="#ffffff">Come on, Brigadier, inside. Inside.</font>

1385
01:21:57,880 --> 01:21:59,880
<font color="#ffffff">Right, forcefield on.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Forcefield's on.</font>

1386
01:22:05,720 --> 01:22:09,760
<font color="#00ffff">Fools. Do you think to deny the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">might of Omega?</font>

1387
01:22:09,760 --> 01:22:12,920
<font color="#00ffff">Soon you will come</font>
<font color="#00ffff">crawling to me for mercy.</font>

1388
01:22:14,240 --> 01:22:17,400
<font color="#00ffff">But by that time, your universe</font>

1389
01:22:17,400 --> 01:22:19,040
<font color="#00ffff">will no longer exist.</font>

1390
01:22:20,480 --> 01:22:22,360
<font color="#ffffff">Well?</font>

1391
01:22:22,360 --> 01:22:25,120
<font color="#ffff00">Energy almost completely exhausted,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">sir.</font>

1392
01:22:25,120 --> 01:22:26,920
<font color="#ffffff">And the latest transference?</font>

1393
01:22:26,920 --> 01:22:29,800
<font color="#ffff00">No contact since we tried to</font>
<font color="#ffff00">pass him through the black hole.</font>

1394
01:22:30,840 --> 01:22:34,560
<font color="#ffff00">The power level was so low that</font>
<font color="#ffff00">he may only be able to observe,</font>

1395
01:22:34,560 --> 01:22:37,080
<font color="#ffff00">advise, not to act.</font>

1396
01:22:37,080 --> 01:22:39,320
<font color="#ffffff">Well, there you are, then.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">They can't get in.</font>

1397
01:22:39,320 --> 01:22:41,240
<font color="#00ffff">And we can't get out.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We're besieged.</font>

1398
01:22:41,240 --> 01:22:43,240
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, great.</font>

1399
01:22:43,240 --> 01:22:44,880
<font color="#00ffff">If only I could find my recorder,</font>

1400
01:22:44,880 --> 01:22:47,480
<font color="#00ffff">I could play you a little something</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to pass the time.</font>

1401
01:22:49,560 --> 01:22:52,360
<font color="#ffffff">We must be thankful</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for small mercies.</font>

1402
01:22:52,360 --> 01:22:55,400
<font color="#00ff00">Well, this TARDIS of yours</font>
<font color="#00ff00">is a real marvel, Doctor.</font>

1403
01:22:55,400 --> 01:22:57,760
<font color="#00ff00">I still don't understand</font>
<font color="#00ff00">how we all got inside it,</font>

1404
01:22:57,760 --> 01:23:00,800
<font color="#00ff00">but I don't wish to</font>
<font color="#00ff00">spend the rest of my life in it.</font>

1405
01:23:00,800 --> 01:23:03,040
<font color="#ffff00">True. We can't just stay here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">forever.</font>

1406
01:23:03,040 --> 01:23:05,520
<font color="#00ff00">Come on, Doc. I mean,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">with two of you,</font>

1407
01:23:05,520 --> 01:23:07,960
<font color="#00ff00">there should be twice as many ideas.</font>

1408
01:23:07,960 --> 01:23:11,560
<font color="#00ff00">Surely you can think up something</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to nobble this Omega bloke?</font>

1409
01:23:11,560 --> 01:23:13,160
<font color="#00ffff">Nobble him?</font>

1410
01:23:13,160 --> 01:23:16,520
<font color="#00ffff">You're talking about one of the most</font>
<font color="#00ffff">powerful blokes in the cosmos.</font>

1411
01:23:16,520 --> 01:23:18,760
<font color="#00ffff">Nobble him?</font>

1412
01:23:16,520 --> 01:23:18,760
<font color="#ffffff">PANEL BEEPS</font>

1413
01:23:18,760 --> 01:23:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse me.</font>

1414
01:23:19,880 --> 01:23:21,800
<font color="#ffffff">Someone's trying to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">get through to us.</font>

1415
01:23:21,800 --> 01:23:24,480
<font color="#00ffff">You don't think...?</font>

1416
01:23:24,480 --> 01:23:26,160
<font color="#ffffff">I hardly think so.</font>

1417
01:23:28,760 --> 01:23:30,360
<font color="#ffff00">There you are, then.</font>

1418
01:23:30,360 --> 01:23:32,160
<font color="#ffff00">What's all this, a mass meeting?</font>

1419
01:23:32,160 --> 01:23:34,960
<font color="#ffffff">Well, we had to bring them all</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in here. It wasn't safe outside.</font>

1420
01:23:34,960 --> 01:23:36,400
<font color="#ffff00">In a pretty pickle, aren't you?</font>

1421
01:23:36,400 --> 01:23:39,560
<font color="#ffffff">HE CHUCKLES</font>

1422
01:23:36,400 --> 01:23:39,560
<font color="#ffff00">Trapped in your own TARDIS.</font>

1423
01:23:39,560 --> 01:23:42,120
<font color="#00ffff">You're trapped in your own bubble.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You can talk!</font>

1424
01:23:42,120 --> 01:23:45,480
<font color="#ffff00">Unfortunately, talk's all I can do,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and not much of that.</font>

1425
01:23:46,840 --> 01:23:50,800
<font color="#ffff00">The transference isn't stable.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Let's get on with it, eh?</font>

1426
01:23:52,240 --> 01:23:54,280
<font color="#00ffff">On with what?</font>

1427
01:23:54,280 --> 01:23:58,120
<font color="#ffff00">Putting our heads together</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and finding a solution.</font>

1428
01:23:58,120 --> 01:24:00,200
<font color="#ffff00">Ready?</font>

1429
01:24:00,200 --> 01:24:02,240
<font color="#00ffff">Ready.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Ready.</font>

1430
01:24:03,160 --> 01:24:05,240
<font color="#00ffff">Contact.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Contact.</font>

1431
01:24:12,440 --> 01:24:16,560
<font color="#ffff00">We're all agreed, then.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Risky, but it could work.</font>

1432
01:24:16,560 --> 01:24:18,800
<font color="#ffff00">I'll report back.</font>

1433
01:24:20,960 --> 01:24:22,680
<font color="#ffffff">We'd have to strip down</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the forcefield.</font>

1434
01:24:22,680 --> 01:24:24,800
<font color="#00ffff">But that'd mean</font>
<font color="#00ffff">leaving the TARDIS defenceless.</font>

1435
01:24:24,800 --> 01:24:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I know,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">but I think we'll have to risk it.</font>

1436
01:24:27,760 --> 01:24:29,960
<font color="#00ffff">It's worth a try! Come on.</font>

1437
01:24:32,960 --> 01:24:34,960
<font color="#00ff00">What was all that about, Miss Grant?</font>

1438
01:24:34,960 --> 01:24:37,080
<font color="#ffff00">Another telepathic conference,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I think.</font>

1439
01:24:38,080 --> 01:24:40,440
<font color="#00ff00">That old chap?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Afraid so.</font>

1440
01:24:41,440 --> 01:24:44,640
<font color="#00ff00">Three of them.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I didn't know when I was well off.</font>

1441
01:24:44,640 --> 01:24:46,600
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, what is it?</font>

1442
01:24:46,600 --> 01:24:48,000
<font color="#00ff00">Would you mind telling us laymen</font>

1443
01:24:48,000 --> 01:24:50,200
<font color="#00ff00">what you scientists are getting</font>
<font color="#00ff00">so excited about?</font>

1444
01:24:50,200 --> 01:24:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">We think we've found a way</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of dealing with Omega.</font>

1445
01:24:52,240 --> 01:24:53,360
<font color="#00ff00">Mind telling me how?</font>

1446
01:24:53,360 --> 01:24:56,520
<font color="#ffffff">Later, old chap. If there's</font>
<font color="#ffffff">still time.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Oh, splendid.</font>

1447
01:24:56,520 --> 01:24:59,120
<font color="#ffffff">But how do we know that</font>
<font color="#ffffff">he'll take the generator?</font>

1448
01:24:59,120 --> 01:25:00,560
<font color="#ffffff">What if he should refuse?</font>

1449
01:25:00,560 --> 01:25:02,680
<font color="#00ffff">Ah! I've found it!</font>

1450
01:25:02,680 --> 01:25:04,400
<font color="#ffffff">Found what?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">My recorder.</font>

1451
01:25:04,400 --> 01:25:05,880
<font color="#00ffff">It must've been there all the time,</font>

1452
01:25:05,880 --> 01:25:07,520
<font color="#00ffff">right in the corner of the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">forcefield.</font>

1453
01:25:07,520 --> 01:25:09,320
<font color="#ffffff">Well, don't touch it.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I wasn't going to.</font>

1454
01:25:09,320 --> 01:25:12,120
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you understand?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's exactly what we want.</font>

1455
01:25:12,120 --> 01:25:14,440
<font color="#ffffff">Far better than the forcefield</font>
<font color="#ffffff">generator.</font>

1456
01:25:14,440 --> 01:25:16,960
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, no, not my recorder.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'll get you another one.</font>

1457
01:25:16,960 --> 01:25:19,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'll get you a hundred. I'll get you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a thousand of them. Come on.</font>

1458
01:25:19,800 --> 01:25:21,400
<font color="#00ffff">I've got a contact, sir.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh?</font>

1459
01:25:21,400 --> 01:25:23,400
<font color="#00ffff">The Doctor.</font>

1460
01:25:26,760 --> 01:25:29,600
<font color="#ffffff">Did you find them?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Did you make contact?</font>

1461
01:25:29,600 --> 01:25:30,760
<font color="#ffff00">For a while.</font>

1462
01:25:30,760 --> 01:25:32,080
<font color="#ffffff">Is there any chance?</font>

1463
01:25:32,080 --> 01:25:34,480
<font color="#ffffff">We can't hold out much longer.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What's happening?</font>

1464
01:25:34,480 --> 01:25:38,840
<font color="#ffff00">There's a possible solution.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'll let you know as soon as I can.</font>

1465
01:25:38,840 --> 01:25:40,800
<font color="#00ffff">Here we are, then.</font>

1466
01:25:40,800 --> 01:25:42,600
<font color="#00ffff">This should do the trick.</font>

1467
01:25:42,600 --> 01:25:45,640
<font color="#00ff00">I suppose it would be too much to</font>
<font color="#00ff00">ask for someone to tell us</font>

1468
01:25:45,640 --> 01:25:47,520
<font color="#00ff00">what all this means.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It means, Brigadier,</font>

1469
01:25:47,520 --> 01:25:49,960
<font color="#ffffff">that we can now strike a bargain</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with our friend Omega.</font>

1470
01:25:49,960 --> 01:25:51,560
<font color="#00ff00">With that box of tricks there?</font>

1471
01:25:51,560 --> 01:25:54,080
<font color="#ffff00">And a flute?</font><font color="#ffffff"> This box of tricks,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">as you call it,</font>

1472
01:25:54,080 --> 01:25:55,720
<font color="#ffffff">is a kind of portable forcefield.</font>

1473
01:25:55,720 --> 01:25:58,840
<font color="#00ffff">And the recorder is considerably</font>
<font color="#00ffff">more than just a recorder.</font>

1474
01:25:58,840 --> 01:25:59,880
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font>

1475
01:25:59,880 --> 01:26:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">Right, ready?</font>

1476
01:26:01,480 --> 01:26:03,640
<font color="#00ffff">Here, just hold this.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, splendid, yes.</font>

1477
01:26:04,720 --> 01:26:06,400
<font color="#ffffff">Right, switch on.</font>

1478
01:26:06,400 --> 01:26:07,840
<font color="#00ffff">On.</font>

1479
01:26:07,840 --> 01:26:09,640
<font color="#ffffff">Omega, we want to talk with you.</font>

1480
01:26:15,520 --> 01:26:17,680
<font color="#00ffff">I hear you, brother Time Lords.</font>

1481
01:26:18,960 --> 01:26:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">We think we have discovered a way</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to give you back your freedom.</font>

1482
01:26:22,200 --> 01:26:25,360
<font color="#ffffff">Will you now free the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#ffffff">so that we can come to you?</font>

1483
01:26:25,360 --> 01:26:30,480
<font color="#00ffff">Is this some deceit? You cannot</font>
<font color="#00ffff">escape my world unless I will it.</font>

1484
01:26:30,480 --> 01:26:32,200
<font color="#ffff00">No, not a bit of it, old chap.</font>

1485
01:26:32,200 --> 01:26:35,120
<font color="#ffff00">We just want to avoid a long</font>
<font color="#ffff00">tiring walk, that's all.</font>

1486
01:26:35,120 --> 01:26:37,400
<font color="#00ffff">Very well.</font>

1487
01:26:37,400 --> 01:26:39,680
<font color="#00ffff">Come to me you shall.</font>

1488
01:26:43,080 --> 01:26:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">Right. Now listen to me, everybody.</font>

1489
01:26:45,160 --> 01:26:47,840
<font color="#ffffff">From now on you are to do</font>
<font color="#ffffff">exactly as you are told.</font>

1490
01:26:47,840 --> 01:26:49,160
<font color="#ffff00">Why? What's going to happen?</font>

1491
01:26:49,160 --> 01:26:51,400
<font color="#ffffff">Now, Jo, please do as I ask.</font>

1492
01:26:51,400 --> 01:26:53,880
<font color="#ffffff">Do exactly as I tell you.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Do you promise?</font>

1493
01:26:53,880 --> 01:26:55,320
<font color="#ffff00">All right, I promise.</font>

1494
01:26:55,320 --> 01:26:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">Good. Are you ready?</font>

1495
01:26:59,080 --> 01:27:01,160
<font color="#ffffff">Stand by. Here we go.</font>

1496
01:27:05,880 --> 01:27:09,080
<font color="#ffffff">VWORP</font>

1497
01:27:27,640 --> 01:27:30,880
<font color="#00ffff">Do you think this trickery</font>
<font color="#00ffff">will save you for long?</font>

1498
01:27:30,880 --> 01:27:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">We have come to set you free...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">What is this?</font>

1499
01:27:33,560 --> 01:27:36,760
<font color="#ffffff">..on one condition.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I make the terms, Time Lords.</font>

1500
01:27:36,760 --> 01:27:40,680
<font color="#ffffff">Omega, if you will send these people</font>
<font color="#ffffff">back to where they came from,</font>

1501
01:27:40,680 --> 01:27:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">we will stay and help you.</font>

1502
01:27:43,520 --> 01:27:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">We think we have devised a way</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of restoring your freedom to you.</font>

1503
01:27:46,720 --> 01:27:48,280
<font color="#00ffff">What way?</font>

1504
01:27:48,280 --> 01:27:51,320
<font color="#00ffff">I know now that you cannot</font>
<font color="#00ffff">give me my freedom,</font>

1505
01:27:51,320 --> 01:27:54,760
<font color="#00ffff">but you can keep me company</font>

1506
01:27:54,760 --> 01:27:58,640
<font color="#00ffff">in the endless empty years</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that lie ahead.</font>

1507
01:27:58,640 --> 01:28:04,120
<font color="#00ffff">If you will both stay here willingly</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and share my exile,</font>

1508
01:28:04,120 --> 01:28:08,600
<font color="#00ffff">then I will spare your friends</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and their universe.</font>

1509
01:28:10,920 --> 01:28:13,040
<font color="#ffffff">We shall give you that promise,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Omega.</font>

1510
01:28:14,240 --> 01:28:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">We will not attempt to leave</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this world before you do.</font>

1511
01:28:17,920 --> 01:28:19,640
<font color="#ffff00">You can't!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Jo, you promised.</font>

1512
01:28:20,800 --> 01:28:23,800
<font color="#00ffff">Go, then, back to your planet.</font>

1513
01:28:26,160 --> 01:28:27,440
<font color="#00ffff">Be gone.</font>

1514
01:28:27,440 --> 01:28:30,720
<font color="#00ffff">And give thanks that Omega</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is merciful.</font>

1515
01:28:36,000 --> 01:28:38,040
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor, what shall we do?</font>

1516
01:28:47,080 --> 01:28:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">Brigadier, I want all of you to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">step through that column of smoke.</font>

1517
01:28:52,560 --> 01:28:54,080
<font color="#00ff00">What?</font>

1518
01:28:54,080 --> 01:28:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be alarmed.</font>

1519
01:28:55,280 --> 01:28:56,480
<font color="#ffffff">It won't harm you.</font>

1520
01:28:56,480 --> 01:28:58,560
<font color="#ffffff">On the contrary,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">it will take you back home.</font>

1521
01:28:59,800 --> 01:29:01,920
<font color="#ffff00">Please, Brigadier,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it's the only way.</font>

1522
01:29:03,040 --> 01:29:05,920
<font color="#00ff00">I don't know what you're up to,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but...all right.</font>

1523
01:29:07,560 --> 01:29:09,360
<font color="#00ff00">Now, Mr Ollis?</font>

1524
01:29:10,600 --> 01:29:12,200
<font color="#ffffff">Not me.</font>

1525
01:29:12,200 --> 01:29:13,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not going in there.</font>

1526
01:29:14,640 --> 01:29:16,200
<font color="#00ff00">Dr Tyler?</font>

1527
01:29:26,880 --> 01:29:28,680
<font color="#00ff00">Are you sure it's all right?</font>

1528
01:29:28,680 --> 01:29:30,680
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, of course I'm sure.</font>

1529
01:29:38,000 --> 01:29:40,200
<font color="#00ff00">Now, then, Mr Ollis.</font>

1530
01:29:56,160 --> 01:29:57,960
<font color="#00ff00">Sergeant Benton.</font>

1531
01:30:08,960 --> 01:30:11,200
<font color="#ffff00">Sir, I'd sooner Miss Grant...</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Move, Benton.</font>

1532
01:30:17,160 --> 01:30:19,480
<font color="#00ff00">Now, then, Miss Grant.</font>

1533
01:30:19,480 --> 01:30:21,800
<font color="#ffff00">No! No, I want to stay</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with the Doctor.</font>

1534
01:30:21,800 --> 01:30:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">Jo, please.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Come on, Jo.</font>

1535
01:30:25,040 --> 01:30:26,840
<font color="#ffffff">WHISPERS: Trust me.</font>

1536
01:30:38,160 --> 01:30:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">You'll be all right.</font>

1537
01:30:50,360 --> 01:30:51,800
<font color="#00ff00">Goodbye, Doctor.</font>

1538
01:30:54,040 --> 01:30:55,760
<font color="#00ff00">Doctors.</font>

1539
01:31:07,000 --> 01:31:12,040
<font color="#00ffff">So, brother Time Lords,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I have played your game.</font>

1540
01:31:12,040 --> 01:31:15,000
<font color="#00ffff">Now it is your turn to play mine,</font>

1541
01:31:15,000 --> 01:31:18,200
<font color="#00ffff">and there can be no escape</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for any of us.</font>

1542
01:31:19,960 --> 01:31:21,480
<font color="#ffff00">You are wrong, Omega.</font>

1543
01:31:22,600 --> 01:31:24,200
<font color="#ffff00">You can have your freedom.</font>

1544
01:31:25,960 --> 01:31:27,680
<font color="#ffff00">It is here.</font>

1545
01:31:27,680 --> 01:31:30,280
<font color="#00ffff">What is this childish contraption?</font>

1546
01:31:30,280 --> 01:31:32,760
<font color="#ffff00">The only freedom you can ever have.</font>

1547
01:31:34,640 --> 01:31:36,320
<font color="#ffff00">Take it.</font>

1548
01:31:40,120 --> 01:31:42,080
<font color="#ffff00">Take it, Omega.</font>

1549
01:31:47,120 --> 01:31:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">OMEGA LAUGHS</font>

1550
01:31:50,640 --> 01:31:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">Take it!</font>

1551
01:31:52,560 --> 01:31:55,480
<font color="#00ffff">Commands?! You command me?!</font>

1552
01:31:57,040 --> 01:31:59,800
<font color="#00ffff">This is my world!</font>

1553
01:31:59,800 --> 01:32:01,800
<font color="#00ffff">I command!</font>

1554
01:32:01,800 --> 01:32:05,000
<font color="#00ffff">And you pester me with trinkets!</font>

1555
01:32:05,000 --> 01:32:06,880
<font color="#ffff00">Run!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Come on, quick.</font>

1556
01:32:29,480 --> 01:32:32,320
<font color="#ffffff">Another source of energy.</font>

1557
01:32:32,320 --> 01:32:35,240
<font color="#ffffff">Once again, Omega.</font>

1558
01:32:39,800 --> 01:32:41,040
<font color="#00ffff">We're back!</font>

1559
01:32:41,040 --> 01:32:44,120
<font color="#00ff00">Well, we certainly seem to be.</font>

1560
01:32:44,120 --> 01:32:46,240
<font color="#00ffff">But we're really back.</font>

1561
01:32:46,240 --> 01:32:47,440
<font color="#ffff00">But the Doctors.</font>

1562
01:32:48,920 --> 01:32:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I dare say they'll turn up</font>
<font color="#ffffff">as usual.</font>

1563
01:32:54,080 --> 01:32:57,240
<font color="#ffffff">SHE SOBS</font>

1564
01:32:57,240 --> 01:33:00,080
<font color="#ffffff">Wonderful chap, both of him.</font>

1565
01:33:01,440 --> 01:33:03,200
<font color="#ffff00">The TARDIS!</font>

1566
01:33:04,760 --> 01:33:06,680
<font color="#ffffff">I told you he had no self-control.</font>

1567
01:33:06,680 --> 01:33:10,200
<font color="#00ff00">How did you manage it?!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">By the skin of our teeth.</font>

1568
01:33:10,200 --> 01:33:11,840
<font color="#00ff00">Splendid.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Where's Mr Ollis?</font>

1569
01:33:11,840 --> 01:33:13,880
<font color="#00ff00">What?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Where's Mr Ollis?</font>

1570
01:33:13,880 --> 01:33:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">Back where he came from, I imagine.</font>

1571
01:33:25,960 --> 01:33:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">So there you are. Omega's will was</font>
<font color="#ffffff">like the tension in the elastic.</font>

1572
01:33:29,640 --> 01:33:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">Once that will was broken,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">all the bits of Earth, UNIT, etc,</font>

1573
01:33:32,720 --> 01:33:34,800
<font color="#ffffff">just snapped back right into</font>
<font color="#ffffff">their proper place.</font>

1574
01:33:34,800 --> 01:33:36,600
<font color="#00ff00">But how come you turned up</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in the TARDIS?</font>

1575
01:33:36,600 --> 01:33:38,080
<font color="#00ffff">That was the proper place for us.</font>

1576
01:33:38,080 --> 01:33:40,120
<font color="#ffff00">What was all that business</font>
<font color="#ffff00">about the flute?</font>

1577
01:33:40,120 --> 01:33:41,160
<font color="#00ffff">Well, as you know,</font>

1578
01:33:41,160 --> 01:33:43,480
<font color="#00ffff">it accidentally fell into the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">forcefield of the TARDIS,</font>

1579
01:33:43,480 --> 01:33:45,680
<font color="#00ffff">so that when we were all</font>
<font color="#00ffff">transformed into antimatter,</font>

1580
01:33:45,680 --> 01:33:47,760
<font color="#00ffff">that was the only thing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that wasn't processed.</font>

1581
01:33:47,760 --> 01:33:49,320
<font color="#ffffff">When Omega knocked it</font>
<font color="#ffffff">out of our hands</font>

1582
01:33:49,320 --> 01:33:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">and it fell out of the forcefield,</font>

1583
01:33:50,760 --> 01:33:53,680
<font color="#ffffff">all the atoms and the anti-atoms</font>
<font color="#ffffff">annihilated one another.</font>

1584
01:33:53,680 --> 01:33:57,400
<font color="#00ff00">So big bang and the black hole</font>
<font color="#00ff00">becomes a supernova.</font>

1585
01:33:57,400 --> 01:33:59,320
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Pity, though.</font>

1586
01:33:59,320 --> 01:34:01,480
<font color="#00ffff">I think it had a lovely tone.</font>

1587
01:34:02,720 --> 01:34:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">MONITOR:</font><font color="#ffff00"> Everything OK?</font>

1588
01:34:09,280 --> 01:34:11,720
<font color="#ffffff">Well, here we are, back safe</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and sound.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Quite a party.</font>

1589
01:34:11,720 --> 01:34:13,880
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, well, the party's over now.</font>

1590
01:34:13,880 --> 01:34:18,200
<font color="#ffff00">You young men and I</font>
<font color="#ffff00">go back to our time zones.</font>

1591
01:34:18,200 --> 01:34:22,000
<font color="#ffff00">Though considering the way</font>
<font color="#ffff00">things have been going, well,</font>

1592
01:34:22,000 --> 01:34:25,560
<font color="#ffff00">I shudder to think</font>
<font color="#ffff00">what you'll do without me.</font>

1593
01:34:25,560 --> 01:34:27,200
<font color="#00ffff">Goodbye.</font>

1594
01:34:27,200 --> 01:34:29,120
<font color="#00ffff">Well, goodbye, everybody.</font>

1595
01:34:29,120 --> 01:34:32,280
<font color="#00ffff">Goodbye.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">It's been so nice to meet me.</font>

1596
01:34:32,280 --> 01:34:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I see what you mean.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I hope I don't meet me again.</font>

1597
01:34:36,000 --> 01:34:37,680
<font color="#00ffff">Ah.</font>

1598
01:34:41,600 --> 01:34:43,600
<font color="#00ff00">Now I've seen it all.</font>

1599
01:34:43,600 --> 01:34:45,200
<font color="#ffff00">Pity.</font>

1600
01:34:45,200 --> 01:34:48,200
<font color="#ffff00">He was so sweet.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, wasn't I?</font>

1601
01:34:51,600 --> 01:34:54,560
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, well, as far as I'm concerned,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor,</font>

1602
01:34:54,560 --> 01:34:58,040
<font color="#00ff00">one of you is enough.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">More than enough.</font>

1603
01:34:59,520 --> 01:35:01,240
<font color="#00ff00">Sergeant Benton?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Sir.</font>

1604
01:35:01,240 --> 01:35:03,360
<font color="#00ff00">You and I'd better make a full</font>
<font color="#00ff00">inventory of the HQ,</font>

1605
01:35:03,360 --> 01:35:04,960
<font color="#00ff00">make sure everything's back</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in place.</font>

1606
01:35:04,960 --> 01:35:06,680
<font color="#00ff00">It's all got to be accounted for,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">you know.</font>

1607
01:35:06,680 --> 01:35:08,280
<font color="#ffff00">Sir?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Yes?</font>

1608
01:35:08,280 --> 01:35:11,680
<font color="#ffff00">Well, excuse me, sir,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">but, well, if anything IS missing,</font>

1609
01:35:11,680 --> 01:35:13,760
<font color="#ffff00">where do we say it's gone?</font>

1610
01:35:16,400 --> 01:35:18,880
<font color="#00ff00">Come along, Benton.</font>

1611
01:35:18,880 --> 01:35:21,400
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I think I'd better</font>
<font color="#00ffff">be on my way too.</font>

1612
01:35:22,680 --> 01:35:25,120
<font color="#00ffff">Thank you for a fascinating trip,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor.</font>

1613
01:35:25,120 --> 01:35:27,880
<font color="#ffffff">Goodbye.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Goodbye.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Goodbye, Jo.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Goodbye.</font>

1614
01:35:29,880 --> 01:35:32,800
<font color="#00ffff">I don't think I'll write it up</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the university journal.</font>

1615
01:35:32,800 --> 01:35:34,680
<font color="#00ffff">Not if I want to keep my job.</font>

1616
01:35:42,040 --> 01:35:44,080
<font color="#ffff00">What's the matter, Doctor?</font>

1617
01:35:44,080 --> 01:35:46,760
<font color="#ffff00">Everything worked out all right,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">didn't it?</font>

1618
01:35:46,760 --> 01:35:48,800
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, for us.</font>

1619
01:35:50,800 --> 01:35:53,600
<font color="#ffff00">I know what it is.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's because you had to trick Omega.</font>

1620
01:35:54,800 --> 01:35:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't exactly trick him.</font>

1621
01:35:57,440 --> 01:35:59,800
<font color="#ffffff">I promised him his freedom</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and I gave it to him.</font>

1622
01:36:01,520 --> 01:36:04,240
<font color="#ffffff">The only freedom he could ever have.</font>

1623
01:36:04,240 --> 01:36:05,880
<font color="#ffff00">What else could you do?</font>

1624
01:36:05,880 --> 01:36:08,640
<font color="#ffff00">It was either him or everything.</font>

1625
01:36:10,120 --> 01:36:12,000
<font color="#ffffff">VWORP</font>

1626
01:36:15,080 --> 01:36:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">The Time Lords.</font>

1627
01:36:19,000 --> 01:36:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">Look, they've sent me</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a new dematerialisation circuit.</font>

1628
01:36:23,440 --> 01:36:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">And my knowledge of time travel law</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and all the dematerialisation codes,</font>

1629
01:36:28,080 --> 01:36:29,480
<font color="#ffffff">they've all come back.</font>

1630
01:36:29,480 --> 01:36:30,880
<font color="#ffffff">They've forgiven me.</font>

1631
01:36:32,240 --> 01:36:34,360
<font color="#ffffff">They've given me back my freedom.</font>

1632
01:36:34,360 --> 01:36:37,040
<font color="#ffff00">I suppose you'll be rushing off,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">then.</font>

1633
01:36:37,040 --> 01:36:39,800
<font color="#ffffff">No, not straight away, Jo.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Of course not.</font>

1634
01:36:39,800 --> 01:36:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">I've got to build a new</font>
<font color="#ffffff">forcefield generator first.</font>

1635
01:36:44,400 --> 01:36:47,240
<font color="#ffffff">And where do you think you've been,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Arthur Ollis?</font>

1636
01:36:47,240 --> 01:36:49,360
<font color="#ffffff">I've been worried sick about you,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I have.</font>

1637
01:36:49,360 --> 01:36:52,040
<font color="#ffffff">Everybody's been searching.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Where have you been?</font>

1638
01:36:52,040 --> 01:36:56,200
<font color="#ffffff">Soldiers looking for you. You didn't</font>
<font color="#ffffff">come home for your dinner. Well?</font>

1639
01:36:59,200 --> 01:37:02,080
<font color="#ffff00">You'd never believe me, woman.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Supper ready?</font>

1640
01:37:05,880 --> 01:37:08,120
<font color="#ffffff">Luke must be having a banging time</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in UNIT.</font>

1641
01:37:08,120 --> 01:37:10,240
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, you would have loved</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the Brigadier.</font>

1642
01:37:10,240 --> 01:37:11,880
<font color="#ffffff">I met him.</font>

1643
01:37:11,880 --> 01:37:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">I mean, he was retired by then,</font>

1644
01:37:13,520 --> 01:37:16,120
<font color="#ffffff">but he helped Sarah Jane break into</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Black Archive</font>

1645
01:37:16,120 --> 01:37:19,160
<font color="#ffffff">to deal with some alien</font>
<font color="#ffffff">tag team trouble.</font>

1646
01:37:19,160 --> 01:37:23,600
<font color="#ffff00">Like I said, the older you get,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the more people you miss.</font>

1647
01:37:25,480 --> 01:37:27,520
<font color="#ffffff">Did you love him?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Who?</font>

1648
01:37:27,520 --> 01:37:29,920
<font color="#ffffff">The Doctor. Your Doctor.</font>

1649
01:37:29,920 --> 01:37:31,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, yes.</font>

1650
01:37:31,600 --> 01:37:33,960
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I loved him so much.</font>

1651
01:37:33,960 --> 01:37:38,160
<font color="#ffff00">Not in the same way</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that I loved Cliff,</font>

1652
01:37:38,160 --> 01:37:43,480
<font color="#ffff00">although I wish the Doctor</font>
<font color="#ffff00">was here now, you know,</font>

1653
01:37:43,480 --> 01:37:46,080
<font color="#ffff00">helping me pick up the pieces.</font>

1654
01:37:46,080 --> 01:37:51,560
<font color="#ffff00">I loved him the same way</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that you loved Sarah Jane.</font>

1655
01:37:52,640 --> 01:37:54,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font>

1656
01:37:54,240 --> 01:37:55,680
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, you're right.</font>

1657
01:37:55,680 --> 01:37:58,680
<font color="#ffff00">Of course I'm right.</font>

1658
01:37:58,680 --> 01:38:00,440
<font color="#ffff00">I've lived too long.</font>

1659
01:38:00,440 --> 01:38:04,080
<font color="#ffff00">I've seen too much to be wrong.</font>

1660
01:38:04,080 --> 01:38:07,520
<font color="#ffff00">And that's why I'm telling you now,</font>

1661
01:38:07,520 --> 01:38:09,760
<font color="#ffff00">you have got to tell her.</font>

1662
01:38:09,760 --> 01:38:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">Tell who...what?</font>

1663
01:38:12,400 --> 01:38:14,280
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, Clyde!</font>

1664
01:38:14,280 --> 01:38:16,640
<font color="#ffff00">Don't play games with me.</font>

1665
01:38:16,640 --> 01:38:18,880
<font color="#ffffff">I play a mean Hungry Hippo.</font>

1666
01:38:18,880 --> 01:38:21,840
<font color="#ffff00">No! No, Clyde,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">don't just joke this away.</font>

1667
01:38:21,840 --> 01:38:24,760
<font color="#ffff00">We're not Time Lords.</font>

1668
01:38:24,760 --> 01:38:26,920
<font color="#ffff00">Our time is short.</font>

1669
01:38:26,920 --> 01:38:29,120
<font color="#ffff00">Don't waste it.</font>

1670
01:38:29,120 --> 01:38:32,600
<font color="#ffff00">If you love Rani,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you just jolly well go and tell her.</font>

1671
01:38:34,400 --> 01:38:35,920
<font color="#ffffff">How did you know?</font>

1672
01:38:35,920 --> 01:38:41,320
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, my darling, I saw it every time</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the two of you were together.</font>

1673
01:38:41,320 --> 01:38:44,720
<font color="#ffff00">And I saw it again just now.</font>

1674
01:38:45,960 --> 01:38:47,400
<font color="#ffff00">It hurts.</font>

1675
01:38:49,360 --> 01:38:50,920
<font color="#ffff00">I know that love.</font>

1676
01:38:53,600 --> 01:38:55,640
<font color="#ffffff">She's so busy, you know?</font>

1677
01:38:57,120 --> 01:39:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">And what she does is important.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What do I do? I just...</font>

1678
01:39:00,280 --> 01:39:03,560
<font color="#ffffff">I write daft comic book stories.</font>

1679
01:39:03,560 --> 01:39:06,440
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, stories are important, Clyde.</font>

1680
01:39:06,440 --> 01:39:08,720
<font color="#ffff00">We're made of stories,</font>

1681
01:39:08,720 --> 01:39:11,640
<font color="#ffff00">and you're missing the most</font>
<font color="#ffff00">important one of all.</font>

1682
01:39:13,280 --> 01:39:16,080
<font color="#ffff00">Mine wasn't the Doctor,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it was Cliff.</font>

1683
01:39:17,120 --> 01:39:21,240
<font color="#ffff00">My darling Clyde,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">don't miss your story with Rani.</font>

1684
01:39:22,520 --> 01:39:24,520
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know how.</font>

1685
01:39:24,520 --> 01:39:26,400
<font color="#ffffff">You know, I...</font>

1686
01:39:26,400 --> 01:39:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">I've just always been the joker.</font>

1687
01:39:28,080 --> 01:39:29,720
<font color="#ffff00">Then tell her in a joke.</font>

1688
01:39:29,720 --> 01:39:32,640
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, but tell her.</font>

1689
01:39:32,640 --> 01:39:38,360
<font color="#ffff00">Our time together, that's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the most precious thing we have.</font>

1690
01:39:39,840 --> 01:39:41,840
<font color="#ffff00">Don't waste it.</font>

1691
01:39:45,240 --> 01:39:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">You're right.</font>

1692
01:39:46,720 --> 01:39:48,120
<font color="#ffffff">SHE CHUCKLES</font>

1693
01:39:48,120 --> 01:39:49,440
<font color="#ffffff">OK, I'm going to find her.</font>

1694
01:39:49,440 --> 01:39:52,240
<font color="#ffff00">Yes.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Are you coming?</font>

1695
01:39:52,240 --> 01:39:54,000
<font color="#ffff00">No.</font>

1696
01:39:54,000 --> 01:39:57,840
<font color="#ffff00">No, I think I'll just stay here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a bit longer.</font>

1697
01:39:59,000 --> 01:40:01,040
<font color="#ffff00">See what other memories</font>
<font color="#ffff00">come to call.</font>

